  <para style="h">Udiana Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <para style="toc2">Udiana Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ndi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ubiereikpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke abaña Ahasaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Ehab akekpa, Mọb emaesọñ iwuod ye Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Ndin Ahasaiya amaadiañña ato ubeed anyọñ amọ ke Sameria ndin amaadat unan. Ndin anye amaadọñ mme isʌñutom, akedọkkọ ammọ, “Ikaa inyʌñ ikinam nduuñọ ito Baal-Sebub, abasi Ekrọn, nọ ediọọñọ me ñyaabọkkọ udọñọ ami.”<verse eid="2KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Ado enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Elaiya awo Tisbe, “Dọọk kaa ke soobo mme isʌñutom adidem Sameria nyʌñ bịp ammọ, ‘Ado sia Abasi ibaaha ke Isrel anye asịn afo akaa useñkpọ ato Baal-Sebub, abasi mbon Ekrọn?’ <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Ke ntoro ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Afo uduudakkake uda ke ñkpana a-afo anaaha do. Ke akpanikọ afo ayaakpa!’ ” Ndin Elaiya amaakaa.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Ke ini mme isʌñutom ekenyọññọ edisoobo adidem, anye amaabịp ammọ, “Nsoo ido yak ndufo etịmme enyọñ edi?”<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ. “Awodeen keed akedisoobo ñnyịn,” “Ndin anye amaibo ñnyịn, ‘Itịmme inyọñ ibịne adidem a-akidọññọ ndufo inyʌñ idọkkọ anye, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ado sia Abasi ibaaha ke Isrel anye asịn afo adọñ mme isʌñutom ekenam nduuñọ eto Baal-Sebub, abasi Ekrọn? Ke ntoro afo uduudakkake uda ke ñkpana a-afo anaaha do. Ke akpanikọ afo ayaakpa!” ’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Adidem amaabịp ammọ, “Nsoo utọ awo akedisoobo ndufo inyʌñ idọkkọ ndufo ñkpọ ami?”<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Anye akesịne ided-ided afọñ anyʌñ akpaha ikpa akanna isịn amọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:8">Adidem amaabo, “Elaiya awo Tisbe akedo ado.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Ndin anye amaadọñ adaiwuod ekọñ ye udịmekọñ amọ awo aba mme duob ebịne Elaiya. Etubom ekọñ ado amaakaa abịne Elaiya, a-aketieghe ke anyọñ abod, anyʌñ akebo anye, “Awo Abasi, adidem abo, ‘Sọiyọ di!’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Elaiya amaabọọrọ etubom ekọñ, “Adieke ami ndooho awo Abasi, yak ikañ ato ke hefịn ndin adusobo fiin ye mme awo aba mme duob mfo!” Ndin ikañ amaato hefịn anyʌñ ata etubom ekọñ ye mbon amọ.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Aketịppe ntom adidem amaamaana adọñ etubom ekọñ mfen ye awo aba mme duob. Adaaha udịmekọñ amaabo anye, “Awo Abasi, ntom ke adidem abo, ‘Tịkke di inikeed!’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Elaiya amaabọọrọ, “Adieke ami ndooho awo Abasi, yak ikañ ato ke hefịn adusobo fiin ye awo aba mme duob mfo!” Ndin ikañ amaato hefịn anyʌñ ata anye ye ideen amọ awo aba mme duob.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Ndin adidem amaadọñ etubom ekọñ ayọhọ ita ye awo aba mme duob amọ. Adaahaekọñ anye ami amaakaa akeduọ ke edọñ ke iso Elaiya. “Awo Abasi,” anye amaakpeiye, “mbọk kpono uwem mmi ye uwem mme awo aba mme duob ami, nditọufọk mfo! <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Se, ikañ ato hefịn ata mme akpa etubom ekọñ ye afịd mbon ammọ. Ado idahami nie ukpono nọ uwem mmi!”<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Elaiya, “Keene anye kaa; kuubaak anye.” Ndin Elaiya amaadakka ada anyʌñ akeene anye abịne adidem.<verse eid="2KI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Anye amaabo adidem, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ado sia Abasi ibaaha ke Isrel se anam nduuñọ anye asịn nọ afo adọñ mme isʌñutom ekenam nduuñọ eto Baal-Sebub, abasi Ekrọn? Sia afo anamma ntom, afo uduudakkake uda ke ñkpana a-afo anaaha do. Ke akpanikọ afo ayaakpa!” <verse eid="2KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Ndin anye amaakpa, kpa naña uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ ato inua Elaiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:17">Sia Ahasaiya ikinieghe ayịn, Yoram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoram asʌk ado ukem ye Yoram</char></note> amaadat itie amọ nte adidem ke ayọhọ isua iba ke ukara Yehoram ayịn Yehosafad adidem Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Amaado afịd ñkpọ ke ukara Ahasaiya, ye se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel?<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Eben Elaiya Edọọk Ekaa Hefịn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Idaha <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeyemme adiben Elaiya ndọọk hefịn ke ekamba afịm, Elaiya ye Elisa ekebañña ke usʌñ a-ammọ eketooho Kilkal edi. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Elaiya amaabo Elisa, “Tie mi; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andọñ miin yak ñka Beteel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Ado Elisa amaabo, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem afo ñko anyʌñ adu uwem, ami nduukpọññọ fiin.” Ammọ ndin emaekaa Beteel.<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Mme nsaña mme prọfed ke Beteel emaewuọñọ edikịt Elisa ndin emaebịp, “Afo amediọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaaben eteufọk mfo ukpọñ fiin mfịn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:3">Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Ntoro, ami mmediọọñọ, ke ntoro ikʌp inua.”<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Ndin Elaiya amaabo anye, “Elisa, tie mi; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andọñ miin yak ñka Yeriko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Ndin anye amaabọọrọ, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem afo ñko anyʌñ adu uwem, ami nduukpọññọ fiin.” Ndin ammọ emaekaa Yeriko.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Mme nsaña mme prọfed ke Yeriko emaekaa ebịne Elisa enyʌñ ebịp anye, “Afo amediọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaaben eteufọk mfo ukpọñ fiin mfịn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ntoro, ami mmediọọñọ, ke ntoro idop uyio.”<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Ndin Elaiya amaabo anye, “Tie mi; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andọñ miin yak ñka Yọdan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem afo ñko anyʌñ adu uwem, ami nduukpọññọ fiin.” Ndin ammọ awo iba emaekaa iso esaña.<verse eid="2KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Awo aba mme duob ke atu mme nsaña prọfed emaekaa ekeda nsan-nsan, esak iso ese itie Elaiya ye Elisa eketuakka eda ke Yọdan. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Elaiya amaaben afọñ amọ, amaanwịn ndin amaaben ayʌppọ mmọọñ ke nnasia ye ke ufiin, ndin ammọ awo iba emaekaaña ke nsaad isọñ.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Ke ammọ emaekekaaña, Elaiya amaabo Elisa, “Ndọkkọ miin, nsoo ke ñkpekan nnam unọọ mbemiso emben miin ukpọñ fiin?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:9">Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Yak ami nnie udeeme sịbidịd mfo itie iba.”<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Elaiya amaabo, “Afo amebeeñe akpọsọñ ñkpọ, ado afo ukpuñkịt idaha embenne miin ukpọñ fiin, ayaado ake mfo, imiidooho ntoro, idiitịppeke.”<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Ammọ ekesʌk esaña enyʌñ esʌk eneme nneme, idaha-idaha ado sariọd ikañ keed ye mme enañmbakara ikañ emaebiọññọ enyʌñ ediañña ammọ awo iba, ndin Elaiya amaadọọk aka hefịn ke idio. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Elisa amaakịt ami ndin asio ñkpo, “Ete mmi! Ete mmi! Mme sariọd ye mme awad enañmbakara Isrel!” Ndin Elisa ikikịtte anye aba. Ndin anye amaamʌm afọñ amọ awaak ke itie iba.<verse eid="2KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Elisa ndin amaaben afọñ Elaiya a-amaakeduọ ato anye ndin amaatịmme akaa akeda ke mben Yọdan. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Anye amaaben afọñ a-akeduọhọ ato Elaiya anyʌñ akama ayʌppọ mmọọñ. Anye amaabịp, “Idaha ado mmọ anye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Elaiya?” Anye amaakemia mmọọñ, mmọọñ amaabakka akaa nnasia anyʌñ akaa ufiin, ndin Elisa amaakaaña aboiyo.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Mme nsaña mme prọfed ke Yeriko, e-ekedaaha ese, emaebo, “Sịbidịd Elaiya adoro Elisa.” Ndin ammọ emaekaa ekesoobo anye enyʌñ etuak iwuod ke isọñ enọ anye. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Ammọ emaebo “Se, ñnyịn nditọufọk mfo iminie mme akop idem ideen aba mme duob. Yak ammọ eka ekeyem eteufọk mfo. Akemeido Sịbidịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaben anye akedot ke anyọñ abod me ke abedeñ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Iyoo, kuudọñ ammọ.”<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Ado ammọ emaeyịre tutu anye ikanna itre adinyịmme aba. Ndin anye amaabo, “Idọñ ammọ.” Ndin ammọ emaedọñ ideen aba mme duob, e-ekeyemme ke usen ita ado ikikịtte anye. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Ammọ ekenyọñ ebịne Elisa, a-akebaaha ke Yeriko, anye amaabo ammọ, “Ami ñkibooho ndufo ikiikaa?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekọk Mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Mbon abio ado emaebo Elisa, “Se, abọọñ ñnyịn, abio ami ada ke eti itie, kpa naña afo akịt, ado mmọọñ adiọọk ndin isọñ inyʌññọ ifọn ñkpọ.”<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Anye amaabo, “Ben ufa ntəño usañ nsọk, ndin sịn inʌñ ke esịd.” Ndin ammọ emaeben esọk anye.<verse eid="2KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Ndin anye amaawuọ akaa idịm ado anyʌñ atop inʌñ asịn, ate, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Ami mmekọk mmọọñ ami. Anye idiinamma aba yak ñkpa me unana nseghe aba ke isọñ.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Ndin mmọọñ ado asʌk afọfọn tutu usen mfịn, akeene ikọ Elisa aketañña.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esak Elisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Elisa amaato do akaa Beteel. Nte anye akesañake ke usʌñ, ñkparawa emaewuọ eto abio edisak Elisa. Ammọ emaebo, “Ebọ, dakka kpọñ itie ami! Ebọ, dakka kpọñ itie ami!” <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Anye amaawọññọ, ase ammọ anyʌñ asueñ ammọ ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ndin mme amọnikọd iba emaewuọñọ ke ikọd ediwai ñkparawa aba mme iba. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Ndin anye amaato do akaa Abod Kamel anyʌñ ato do anyọñ akaa Sameria.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mọb Asọñ iwuod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Yoram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoram asʌk ado ukem ye Yoram; se ñko ke 2 Nd 3:6</char></note> ayịn Ehab amaadido adidem Isrel ke Sameria ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara Yehosafad adidem Yuda, ndin anye amaakara isua duob mme iba. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado idooho naña ete ye eka amọ ekenam. Anye amaabiat asaña-asaña itiad Baal ete amọ akenamma asio. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Kpayeado anye amaayiire ke mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, anye akenamma Isrel enam; anye ikiwọññọke ikpọñ ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Ndin Mesa adidem Mọb amaabọọk edọñ, ndin akena anye akpe adidem Isrel isob ñyịn edọñ tọsịn ikie (100,000) ye idededọñ ake mme akukịmedọñ tọsịn ikie (100,000). <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Ado ke Ehab amaakekpa, adidem Mọb amaasọñ iwuod ye adidem Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Ndin ke ini ado adidem Yoram amaato ke Sameria anyʌñ akoono afịd Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Anye amaanyʌñ adọñ etob ami esọk Yehosafad adidem Yuda: “Adidem Mọb a-asọñ iwuod ye ami. Afo ayañkeene miin akaa akenwana ye Mọb?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñyaukeene fiin. Ami udo fiin, mbon mmi enyʌñ edo mbon mfo, mme enañmbakara mmi nte mme enañmbakara mfo.”<verse eid="2KI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Anye amaabịp, “Akee usʌñ ke ñnyịn idiinwana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ke Akpautatan Edọm.”<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaadakka ye adidem Yuda ye adidem Edọm. Ke emaekesaaña ekanna ke usen itiaba, udịmekọñ ikinieghe mmọọñ aba inọ idem ammọ ye mme unam e-ekesañake ye ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Adidem Isrel amaasio ñkpo. “Kọm nsoo! Ado nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akikoot ñnyịn ndidem ita ami yak iyaak ñnyịn asịn ke ubọk mbon Mọb?”<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Ado Yehosafad amaabịp, “Ado nte prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndomokeed ibaaha mi, se ñnyịn ikpibịp ito <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Etubom ekọñ adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ, “Elisa ayịn Safad mmọ mi. Anye akesikama mmọọñ uyieubọk anọ Elaiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awuọñọke ke anye akedo asaña-asaña ayịnufọk Elaiya</char></note>”<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Yehosafad amaabo, “Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo ye anye.” Ndin adidem Isrel ye Yehosafad ye adidem Edọm emaekaa ekekịt anye.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Elisa amaabo adidem Isrel, “Nsoo ido nọ ayem imben miin nsịn? Kaa bịne mme prọfed ete mfo ye mme prọfed eka mfo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">Adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ, “Iyoo, sia ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akikoot ñnyịn ndidem ita adiyaak nsịn Mọb ke ubọk.”<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Elisa amaabo, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan aduuho uwem, ake ami nnamma ñkpọ nnọ, akpedo ñkenieghe ukpono nnọ iso Yehosafad adidem Yuda, ami ñkpikikpañña utọñ unọọ fiin. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Ado idaha ado koot awo abre ekpa nnọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:15">Ke ini abre ekpa akesʌkkọ abre, ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadoro Elisa <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />ndin anye amaabo, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ami ñyaayọhọ abedeñ ami ye ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ. <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Sia ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ndufo idiikịtte afịm me edịm, ado abedeñ ami ayaayọhọ ye mmọọñ, ndin ndufo, mme enañ ndufo ye mme unam ndufo mfen eyaenwọñ. <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Ami ado mmem-mmem ñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; anye ayaanyʌñ ayaak Mọb isịn ndufo ke ubọk. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Ndufo eyaesuan afịd ñkpọsọñ abio ye afịd ikpọ abio. Ndufo eyaekpeeñe eduọñọ afịd nti eto, esiit afịd mme idịm, enyʌñ nsobo afịd nti inwañ ye mme itiad.”<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Ubakusen edem usen, ke ñkpọ nte ini enọ uwa, ete ise akeba do, mmọọñ a-afeghe ato efaak Edọm! Ndin isọñ amaayọhọ ye mmọọñ.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Ndin afịd mbon Mọb emaekop ke mme ndidem emaedi edinwana ye ammọ; ke ntoro emaekoot afịd awo, iwaad ye usọñ, e-ekemeke edikama ñkpọ ekọñ enyʌñ edaaha ammọ ke adaña. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Ammọ ekedemme usiere ubakusen, utịn akesʌk ayama ke anyọñ mmọọñ. Mbon Mọb ekedaaha ekịt ke edem uko, aketie ammọ ndad-ndad nte iyiib. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Ammọ emaebo, “Iyiib adoodo! Mme ndidem ado enwana eduwotto idem ammọ. Idaha ado yak ika mbịme, Mọb!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Ado mbon Mọb ekediwuọ itie ekọñ mbon Isrel, mbon Isrel emaedaaña enwana ye ammọ tutu ammọ efeeñe. Ndin mbon Isrel emaedọñọ isọñ emaenyʌñ ewoot mbon Mọb. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Ammọ emaesobo mme abio, ndin awo keedekeed emaetop itiad esịn ke afịd eti inwañ tutu efʌk anye. Ammọ emaesiit afịd idịm enyʌñ ekpook afịd nti eto. Kii Haresed kpọd akesʌhọ ye itiad ke itie, ado mme ideen emaekama itiad ekanna ekʌk enyʌñ enwana ye anye.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Ke ini adidem Mọb akekịtte ke ekọñ itoppoke anye, anye amaadat mbon akañkañ ikie itiaba adifakka ñwuọ ñkesịm adidem Edọm, ado ammọ ikikanna. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Ndin anye amaaben akpan amọ, a-akenaaha adat itie amọ nte adidem, anọ anye nte uwa ke ndibene abio. Ifiobesịd ammọ ye Isrel amaakpon eti-eti; ammọ emaetịmme edem enyọñ idịd ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Adan Ọlif Ebekpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Anwaan awo ke atu mme nsaña mme prọfed amaatua abịne Elisa, “Afʌnadeen mfo ebe mmi akpa, ndin afo amediọọñọ ke anye amaateeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ado idahami awo anye akekamake isọn adi adikoono nditọ ideen mmi iba nte ifʌn.”<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Elisa amaabọọrọ anye, “Die ke ami mbiikan unwam fiin? Ndọkkọ miin, nsoo ke afo anie ke ufọk mfo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:2">Anye amaabo, “Afʌnanwaan mfo inieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed, ibọhọke etək atu adan ọlif.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Elisa amaabo anye, “Kaa ke saña beeñe mme mbọhọidʌñ mfo mme ukpọk atu. Kuubeeñe etək-etək. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Ndin dʌk esịd ufọk nyʌñ bet usʌñ baha idem mfo ye nditọ ideen mfo. Tọkkọ adan dọñ ke afịd mme atu, ndin naña ammọ keedekeed ayọhọ, tuut nịm ñkañ keed.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Anye amaakpọñ anye anyʌñ abet usʌñ asịn idem amọ ye nditọ ideen amọ. Ammọ emaekoono mme atu esọk anye ndin anye amaakaa iso atọi. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Ke ini afịd atu emaekeyọhọ, anye amaabo ayịn amọ awodeen, “Ben mfen nsọk.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:6">Ado anye amaabọọrọ, “Atu mfen ibaaha aba.” Ndin adan amaatre adiwuọ.<verse eid="2KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Anye amaakaa akedọkkọ awo Abasi, ndin anye amaabo, “Kaa, ke nyam adan ado nyʌñ kpe isọn mfo. Afo ye nditọ ideen mfo emekeme edidu uwem ke se isʌhọ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enam Ayịn Awodeen Awonwaan Sunem Amaana Adu Uwem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Usen keed Elisa amaakaa Sunem. Ndin anieñkpọ awonwaan amaaba do, a-akenyịkke anye abo yak atie adia ñkpọ. Ndin ini akeedodo anye akediighe udo, anye amaawakka do adia ñkpọ. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Awonwaan ami amaabo ebe amọ, “Ami mmediọọñọ ke ete ami a-asidiighe ukañ ñnyịn mi ado adisana awo Abasi. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Yak ñnyịn inam etək ubeed ke akọm inyʌñ isịn akwañ, ye akpokoro, ñkpọitie ye utuenikañ inọ anye. Ndin anye akeme adiba do ini ake anye adedi ibịne ñnyịn.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Usen keed Elisa akedi, anye amaadọọk akaa ubeed amọ anyʌñ asuuk anaa do. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Anye amaabo ayịnufọk amọ Kehasi, “Koot awonwaan Sunem.” Ndin anye amaakoot anye, ndin anye amaada ke iso Elisa. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Elisa amaabo anye, “Dọkkọ anye, ‘Afo amenam afịd ñkpọ ami inọ ñnyịn. Idahami nsoo ke ekpekan enam unọọ fiin? Ñnyịn imikeme editañ ikọ ubaña fiin nnọọ adidem me adaiso udịmekọñ?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmenie ufọk ke atu mbon mmi.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Elisa amaabịp, “Nsoo ke ekpenam enọ anye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:14">Kehasi amaabo, “Anye inieghe ayịn awodeen, ndin ebe amọ asọñ.”<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Ndin Elisa amaabo, “Koot anye.” Ndin anye amaakoot anye, ndin anye amaada ke inuausʌñ. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Elisa amaabo, “idaha ini ntom isua mfen, afo ayaakama ayịn awodeen ke ubọk mfo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">Anye amaafaaña, “Iyoo, abọọñ mmi! Mbọk, awo Abasi, kuutịn afʌnanwaan mfo usʌñ!”<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Ado awonwaan ado amaayommo idịb, ndin isua mfen ke ukem idaha ini ado anye amaaman ayịn awodeen, kpa naña Elisa akedọkkọ anye.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Ayịn ado amaakpon, ndin usen keed anye amaawuọ abịne ete amọ, a-akebaaha ye mbon idọk. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Anye amaabo ete amọ, “Iwuod mmi! Iwuod mmi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">Ete amọ amaabo ayịnufọk keed, “Ben anye sọk eka amọ.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Ayịnufọk amaadịppe anye aben anye asọk eka amọ, anye amaatie ke ifʌkkọ eka amọ tutu ufọọd uweemeayio, ndin anye amaakpa. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Eka amọ amaadọọk akaa akenịm anye ke akwañ awo Abasi, ndin abet usʌñ awuọ.<verse eid="2KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Anye amaakoot ebe amọ anyʌñ abo, “Mbọk dọñ ayịnufọk keed ye dọñki keed embịne nọ ñkekịt awo Abasi usọp-usọp ñnyʌñ ntịmme ndi.”<verse eid="2KI 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Anye amaabịp, “Nsoo ido yak abiika ibịne anye mfịn?” “Mfịn idooho Ufa Afiọñ me usen Sabad.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:23">Anye amaabo, “Mfịna ibaaha.”<verse eid="2KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Anye amaadọọk dọñki ndin abo ayịnufọk amọ, “Saña iso; kuuteek isañ ke ntak mmi ibọhọke ami ubo fiin.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Ndin anye amaadakka akaa adikịt awo Abasi ke Abod Kamel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:25">Awo Abasi akeda akịt awonwaan ado ke anyan usʌñ, anye amaabo ayịnufọk amọ Kehasi, “Se! Awo Sunem ado ado ako! <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Feghe bịne anye ndin bịp anye, ‘Ñkpọ afọn ye afo? Ñkpọ afọn ye ebe mfo? Ñkpọ afọn ye ayịn mfo?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Afịd ñkpọ afọn.”<verse eid="2KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Anye akedisịm awo Abasi ke abod, anye amaamʌm anye ukod. Kehasi amaadi adinək anye nsio, ado awo Abasi amaabo, “Saana anye yaak! Anye aba ke ataa ntaeded, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andịp miin inyʌññọ indọkkọ miin ntak.”<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Anye amaabo, “Anie nte ñkubeeñe fiin ayịn, abọọñ mmi? Ñkubooho fiin, ‘Kuudịppe idodanyen mmi ke anyọñ’?”<verse eid="2KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Elisa amaabo Kehasi, “Nuuk afọñ mfo sịn ke ñkpaha mfo ben eto mmi ke ubọk mfo nyʌñ feghe. Kuukọọm awo ndomokeed ake afo asooboke, ndin awo ndomokeed akpukọọm fiin, kuubọọrọ. Dot esañ mmi ke iso ayịn ado.”<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Ado eka ayịn ado amaabo, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem ndin afo adu uwem, ami nduukpọññọ fiin.” Ndin anye amaadakka ada akeene anye.<verse eid="2KI 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Kehasi amaaboiyo akaa akedot eto ado ke iso ayịn, ado uyio me ibọọrọ ikibaaha. Ndin Kehasi amaatịmme abịne Elisa anyʌñ adọkkọ anye, “Ayịn awodeen ado idemmeke.”<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Ke ini Elisa amaakekewuọ ufọk, se etəkayịn awodeen anaaha do adukpo ke ñkpana amọ. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Anye amaadʌk, abet usʌñ abaha ammọ awo iba ndin abọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Ndin anye amaadọọk akwañ anyʌñ anyanna anaa ke anyọñ ayịn ado, inua ke inua, anyen ke anyen, ubọk ke ubọk. Naña anye akekaaha iso anyanna idem ke idem ayịn, idem ayịn ado amaatọọñọ adifiop. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Elisa amaawọññọ asaña akaa iso, akaa edem ke ubeed ado, ndin anyanna anaa ke idem ayịn ado inikeed mfen. Ayịn amaawaiya akañ itiaba ndin ataat anyen.<verse eid="2KI 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Elisa amaakoot Kehasi ndin abo, “Koot awo Sunem.” Ndin anye amaanam. Anye akedi, anye amaabo, “Ben ayịn mfo.” <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Anye amaadʌk adi, amaaduọ ke ukod amọ anyʌñ atuak iwuod ke isọñ. Ndin anye amaaben ayịn amọ anyʌñ awuọ.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa ke Ako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Elisa amaanyọñ akaa Kilkal ndin akañ amaaba ke afịd efaak ado. Ke ini nditọ mme prọfed ekesooboke ye anye, anye amaabo ayịnufọk amọ, “Dot ekamba ako ke ikañ nyʌñ tem abak nọ mme prọfed.”<verse eid="2KI 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Keed ke atu ammọ amaakaa ikọd akekịppe mme mfañ ye mme fain ikọd anyʌñ akịppe uwak ikịm se afọñ amọ akekan akama. Anye akenyọñ adi, anye amaakpok ammọ adọñ ke ako abak, akpesʌkado awo ndomokeed ikidiọọñọke se edoñño. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Emaetappa abak ado enọ ideen ado, ado ammọ eketọọñọ edidia anye, ammọ emaesio ñkpo, “Awo Abasi, ñkpa mmọdo asịne ke ako!” Ndin ammọ ikikanna idia anye.<verse eid="2KI 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Elisa amaabo, “Innọ ndomuyo.” Anye amaasịn ke ako ndin amaabo, “Nọ mme awo edia.” Ndin idiọọkñkpọ ndomokeed ikisịneke ke ako.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enọ Awo Ikie Ndidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Awodeen amaato Baal Salisa, aben uyo baali edịb ekedatta akpa mbunwịm abakpa etem asọk awo Abasi, ye mme ufa abakpa ke ekpad. Elisa amaabo, “Nọ mbon awo edia.”<verse eid="2KI 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Ayịnufọk amọ amaabịp, “Ami mbiinam die nnịm ami nnọ ideen ikie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:43">Ado Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Nọ mbon awo edia. Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo adom: ‘Ammọ eyaedia ndin ayọhọ asʌhọ.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Ndin anye amaadot ke iso ammọ, ndin ammọ emaedia anyʌñ ayọhọ asʌhọ, kpa naña ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọk Neman Akpamfia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Ndin Neman akedo adaiso udịmekọñ adidem Aram. Anye akedo ekamba awo ke iso eteufọk amọ anyʌñ anie ukpono, sia amaato ke ubọk amọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpọñ adikan anọ Aram. Anye akedo uko awo ekọñ, ado amaanie akpamfia.<verse eid="2KI 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Ndin udịm mbon anwan Aram emaewuọ ekemʌm etək abọikpa Isrel, ndin anye akedo ayịnufọk anwaan Neman. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Anye amaabo ekaufọk amọ, “Akpekapado eteufọk mmi akpaakekịt prọfed a-abaaha ke Sameria! Anye akpaakọk anye akpamfia amọ.”<verse eid="2KI 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Neman amaakaa abịne eteufọk amọ anyʌñ akedọkkọ anye se abọikpa Isrel ado akebo. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Adidem Aram amaabọọrọ “Naña akpedodo, kaa. Ami ñyaanọ ñwedetob esọk adidem Isrel.” Ndin Neman amaadakka, asaña ye talen silfa duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 340</char></note>, udomo sekel kold tọsịn itiokeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 69</char></note> ye ukpʌhọ afọñ duob. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Ñwedetob a-anye akebenne asọk adidem Isrel akebo: “Ye ñwedetob ami mmenọ afʌnadeen mmi Neman usọk fiin nọ afo akọk anye akpamfia amọ.”<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Ke ini adidem Isrel akekoodo ñwedetob ami, anye amaawai mme afọñ amọ ke ndịk anyʌñ abo, “Ami ndo Abasi? Ami ñkpaakan ñwot ñnyʌñ mmaana nnọ uwem? Nsoo ido nọ awo ami anọ awo ansọk miin abo ñkọk anye akpamfia? Se naña anye atọọñọ ñyemikọ ye ami!”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Ndin Elisa awo Abasi akekop ke adidem Isrel amaawai mme afọñ amọ, anye amaanọ etob ami esọk anye: “Nsoo ido nọ afo awai mme afọñ mfo? Nọ awo ado ensọk miin ndin anye ayaadiọọñọ ke prọfed mmọdo ke Isrel.” <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Ndin Neman amaasaña ye mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd amọ anyʌñ akeda ke usʌñ ufọk Elisa. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Elisa amaadọñ isʌñutom akebo anye, “Kaa, yie idem mfo akañ itiaba ke Yọdan, ndin idem mfo ayaamaana aba naña akpeba ndin afo ayaasana.”<verse eid="2KI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Ado Neman amaakpakka esịd ndin amaabo, “Ami ñkekere ke anye ayaawuọ adimbịne miin anyʌñ ada akoot anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ, afʌñ ubọk ke inia ado ndin añkọk miin akpamfia. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Ado nte Abana ye Faapa, mme inyañ Damaskọs ifọọnọ ikan afịd mme mmọọñ Isrel? Ado nte ñkpekanna ñyie ke esịd ammọ ñnyʌñ nsana?” Ndin anye amaawọññọ iso anyọñ ke ifiobesịd.<verse eid="2KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Nditọufọk Neman emaekaa ekebo anye, “Ete mmi, adieke prọfed akpubooho fiin yak anam ekamba ñkpọ, afo ukpunamma? Nwaanwa dise, ndin, idaha anye ubooho fiin, ‘Yie nyʌñ sana’!” <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Ndin anye amaakaa akenyiin idem amọ ke Yọdan akañ itiaba, naña awo Abasi akedọkkọ anye, ndin idem amọ amaafọn anyʌñ asana nte idem etək akparawa.<verse eid="2KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Ndin Neman ye afịd udịm amọ emaetịmme ebịne awo Abasi ado. Anye amaada ke iso amọ ndin amaabo, “Idahami ami mmediọọñọ ke Abasi mfen ibaaha ke afịd ederimbod ke imiibọhọke ke Isrel. Ke ntoro mbọk bọ enọ to afʌnadeen mfo.”<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Prọfed amaabọọrọ, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ake ami nnamma ñkpọ nnọ, aduuho uwem, ami ndiibọọhọ ñkpọ ndomokeed.” Ñko akpesʌkado Neman akekpeiyeke anye, anye amaasịn.<verse eid="2KI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Neman amaabo “Akpedo afo ubọọhọ, mbọk yak ennọ miin, afʌnadeen mfo, ntan se iwak ikem se ñwaahadọñki iba ekpebiom, sia afʌnadeen mfo idiiwaaha uwa inọ abasi mfen ndomokeed imiibọhọke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Ado yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adakkado anọ afʌnadeen mfo ke ñkpọ keed ami: Idaha eteufọk mmi adʌkkọ tembịd Rimọn adituak iwuod ndin anye abere ke ubọk mmi a-adooho ana ami ñkeene ntuak iwuod ñko, ami mmaatuak iwuod ke tembịd Rimọn, yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afeen afʌnadeen mfo ke edinam ami.”<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Elisa amaabo, “Kaa ke emem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Neman amaakesaña etək, <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Kehasi, ayịnufọk Elisa awo Abasi, amaabo idem amọ, “Eteufọk mmi amaasaana Neman awo Aram ami ayaak, asịn adibọ se anye akekoono adi. Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho, ami ñyaafeghe mbịne anye ñnyʌñ mbọ ñkpọ nto anye.”<verse eid="2KI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Ndin Kehasi amaafeghe abịne Neman. Neman akekịt naña Kehasi afeghe abịne anye, anye amaasọiyọ ke sariọd akaa adikisoobo ye anye. Anye amaabịp, “Afịd ñkpọ afọn?”<verse eid="2KI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Kehasi amaabọọrọ, “Afịd ñkpọ afọn. Eteufọk mmi akendọñ miin yak ndibo, ‘Ñkparawa iba ke atu nditọ prọfed edi idaha ado eto abio abod Ifrem. Mbọk nọ ammọ talen silfa keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note> ye ukpʌhọ afọñ iba.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Neman amaabo, “Mfịna ibaaha, dat talen iba.” Anye amaakpek Kehasi abọi mme ñkpọ ado, ndin emaetobo talen silfa iba ado ke ekpad iba, ye ukpʌhọ afọñ iba. Anye amaanọ nditọufọk amọ eben esaña ke iso Kehasi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Kehasi akediwuọ, anye amaabọi nditọufọk ado mme ñkpọ ado anyʌñ abono ke ufọk. Anye amaasio ideen ado unyọñ ndin ammọ emaenyọñọ.<verse eid="2KI 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Ke ini anye akedʌkkọ akeda ke iso eteufọk amọ, Elisa amaabịp anye, “Kehasi, akeba ke mmọọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Kehasi amaabọọrọ, “Afʌnadeen mfo ikiikaaha itie ndomokeed.”<verse eid="2KI 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Ado Elisa amaabo anye, “Nte sịbidịd mmi ikibaaha ye afo idaha ete ado akesọiyọke ke sariọd amọ adusoobo fiin? Nte ini ado ami adibọ akʌk me adibọ mme afọñ, me inwañ ọlif ye inwañ fain, me udịmedọñ, me ufene, me ifʌn ideen ye ifʌn ibaan? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Akpamfia Neman ayaukeene fiin ye ubon mfo ke nsi-nsi.” Ndin Kehasi amaakpọñ iso Elisa ndin idem amọ amaakappa ado akpamfia, amaakappa afia nte sino.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Iwuod Ekịd Afiọrọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Mme nditọ prọfed emaebo Elisa, “Se, itie se ñnyịn isisoobo ye afo asịp abọhọ inọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Yak ñnyịn ikaa Yọdan, nọ awo keedekeed adat eto; ndin yak ñnyịn ibọp itie se ñnyịn isoobo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Ndin anye amaabo, “Ikaa.”<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Ndin keed ke atu ammọ amaabo, “Mbọk afo uduukeeneke nditọufọk mfo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:3">Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñyaadi.” <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Ndin anye amaakeene ammọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:4">Ammọ emaekaa Yọdan ekekpok mme eto. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Keed ke atu ammọ akesʌk akpịkke eto, ukwak iwuod ekịd amaaduọ adʌk mmọọñ. Anye amaasio ñkpo, “O, iyoo, abọọñ mmi! Ñkebeebeeñe!”<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Awo Abasi amaabịp, “Akeduọ ke ñke?” Anye akewọt anye itie, Elisa amaakpịkke eto atop asịn ke ndo, anyʌñ anam ukwak ado afiọrọ. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Anye amaabo, “Dịppe anye sio.” Ndin awo ado amaanyan ubọk asio anye.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Atap Mbon Aram Ekeforoke Nnan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Ndin adidem Aram akeba ke ekọñ ye Isrel. Anye akekọọk iwuod ama ye mme adaaha amọ, anye amaabo, “Ami ñyaanịm nnaaekọñ mmi ke itie ntom ye itie ntom.”<verse eid="2KI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Ndin awo Abasi amaadọñ etob anọ adidem Isrel: “Kpeme kuusaña efaak ado, sia mbon Aram eyaekaa efaak udo.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaakese itie a-awo Abasi akebooho. Ini ke ini Elisa amaawuuk adidem mbara, nọ anye akpeme mme utọ itie ado.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Ñkpọ ami amaayat adidem Aram. Anye amaakoot mme adaaha amọ anyʌñ abịp ammọ, “Indọkkọ miin! Anie ke atu ñnyịn adiana ye adidem Isrel?”<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Keed ke atu mme etubom ekọñ amaabo, “Ibaaha awo ñnyịn, abọọñ mmi adidem, ado Elisa, prọfed a-abaaha ke Isrel, adọkkọ adidem Isrel ukem ikọ a-afo asịneke ke esịd ubeed mfo atañ.”<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Adidem amaanọ uyio, “Ikaa, idiọọñọ nte anye aba, nọ ami ndọñ ideen ekemʌm anye.” Etob amaato adi: “Anye aba ke Dotan.” <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Ndin anye amaadọñ mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd ye akpọsọñ mbon ekọñ. Ammọ emaekaa ke akonayio ekekanna abio ado ekʌk.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Ke ini ayịnufọk awo Abasi amaakebak adakka ubakusen edem usen awuọ esiin, udịmekọñ ye mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd emaekanna abio ekʌk. “O iyoo, abọọñ mmi! Nsoo ke ñnyịn idiinam?” ayịnufọk amaabịp.<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Prọfed amaabọọrọ, “Kuukop ndịk. Mbon se iba ye ñnyịn ewak ekan mbon se iba ye ammọ.”<verse eid="2KI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Ndin Elisa amaabọñ akam, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, tat anye anyen, nọ anye akịt.” Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatat anyen ayịnufọk, ndin anye amaase anyʌñ akịt mme abod naña eyọhọ ye mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd ikañ ekanna Elisa.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Naña mbon asua ekesọiyọ edi ebịne anye, Elisa amaabọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “Nam udịmekọñ ami ekappa nnan.” Ndin anye amaanam ammọ ekappa edo nnan, naña Elisa akebeeñe.<verse eid="2KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Elisa amaadọkkọ ammọ, “Idooho usʌñ adom inyʌññọ ido abio adom. Iñkeene miin, ndin ami ñyaiben ndufo ñkewọt awodeen ake ndufo eyemme.” Ndin anye amaadat ammọ akaa Sameria.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Ke ammọ emaekedʌk abio, Elisa amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, tat anyen ideen ami yak ammọ ekịt usʌñ.” Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatat ammọ anyen ndin ammọ emaekịt ke mmimọ ikiba ke esịd Sameria.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Adidem Isrel akekịt ammọ, anye amaabịp Elisa, “Ñwot ammọ, ete mmi? Ñwot ammọ?”<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Kuuwot ammọ,” “Afo akpaawot mbon ake afo amʌmmọ ke akañkañ me ke utịgha? Nịm ndidia ye mmọọñ nọ ammọ nọ ammọ edia enyʌñ enwọñ ndin enyọñ ebịne eteufọk ammọ.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Ndin anye amaanam ekamba usọrọ anọ ammọ, ndin ke emaekedia enyʌñ enwọñ ema, anye amaanọ ammọ enyọñ, ndin ammọ emaenyọñ ebịne eteufọk ammọ. Ndin udịm mbon anwan e-etooho Aram emaetre edidi ikọ ke isọñ Isrel.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akañ ke Sameria Emaekekanna Ekʌk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Akemaanako, Ben-Hadad adidem Aram amaakoono afịd udịmekọñ amọ ndin esaña edọọk ekekanna Sameria ekʌk. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Ekamba akañ amaaba ke abio Sameria; ukanna abio ñkʌk amaakpeene tutu iwuod dọñki anyama ke sekel silfa anaañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 920</char></note>, ye mbakka keed ke itie inaañ udomo ñkpasi uduañ ibiom <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 100</char></note> anyama ke sekel ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 58</char></note>.<verse eid="2KI 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Naña adidem Isrel akesañake aboiyo ke mben ndibene, awonwaan amaatua akoot anye, “Ñnyaaña miin, abọọñ mmi adidem!”<verse eid="2KI 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Adidem amaabọọrọ, “Adieke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> umuunyaañake fiin, ami ndiidat mmọọ unwam unọ fiin? Ke afe ubeek abakpa? Ke afe unyịmme ukọd?” <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Ndin adidem amaabịp anye, “Nsoo ido mfịna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Awonwaan ami akembo miin, ‘Ben ayịn mfo di nọ ita mfịn, ndin ñkpọñ ñnyịn ita ayịn mmi.’ <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Ndin ñnyịn imaitem ayịn mmi inyʌñ ita. Edem usen ami mmaabo anye, ‘Ben ayịn mfo di nọ ita,’ ado anye amaakedịp anye.”<verse eid="2KI 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Adidem akekop ikọ awonwaan ado, anye amaawai mme afọñ amọ. Nte anye akesañake ke mben ndibene, mme awo emaese, ndin ammọ emaekịt ke idak mme afọñ amọ, anye amaasịne afọñikpo. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Anye amaabo, “Yak Abasi anam ye ami, anyʌñ anekke anam akan, adieke iwuod Elisa ayịn Safad adoroke anye ke afara mfịn ami!”<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Ndin Elisa aketie ke ufọk amọ, ndin mme ñkpisọñ emaetie ye anye. Adidem amaadọñ isʌñutom ato aka, ado mbemiso anye adiwuọ, Elisa amaabo mme ñkpisọñ, “Ndufo ikịtte naña awodawo ami adọñ awo adiñkpịkke miin iwuod asio? Se, isʌñutom amaadi, ibet usʌñ inyʌñ ibet ibaaha anye. Idooho uyom ikpadisañ eteufọk amọ adodo ke edem amọ?” <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Idaha anye asʌkkọ atañ ikọ ye ammọ, isʌñutom amaadisịme anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:33">Adidem amaabo, “Afanekọñ ami ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ntak ami ñkpebette <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba-a?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Kop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ adom: Ñkpọñ idaha ntom, ediinyam udomo ndomuyo keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 5.5; se ñko ke 2 Nd 7:16 ye 18</char></note> ke sekel keed ndin udomo baali iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 9; se ñko ke 2 Nd 7:16 ye 18</char></note> ayaanyama ke sekel keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 12; se ñko ke 2 Nd 7:16 ye 18</char></note> ke inuaatob Sameria.”<verse eid="2KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Ekamba awo ekọñ ake adidem akebereke amaabo awo Abasi, “Se, akpekọm <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpebeere mme inuaatob ke mme hefịn, ñkpọ ntom akeme aditịppe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Afo ayaakịt ke anyen mfo, ado afo uduudiaha ndomokeed!”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edịppe Ukannañkʌk Esio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Ndin ideen inaañ ekenieghe akpamfia emaetie ke inuaatob abio. Ammọ emaebo emọ-emọ, “Ntak añnyịn itieghe ke mmi tutu ikpaa? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Adieke ñnyịn ibooho, ‘Yak ñnyịn ika esịd abio’ akañ aba do, ndin ñnyịn iyaikpa. Ndin adieke ñnyịn ibaaha mi, ñnyịn iyaikpa. Ke ntoro yak ikaa nnaaekọñ mbon Aram ikiyaak idem inọ ammọ. Adieke ammọ eyakka ñnyịn idu, ñnyịn idu; ammọ ekpiwot ñnyịn, ndin ñnyịn ikpa.”<verse eid="2KI 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Ke ayio atọọñọke ifʌk awo idem ammọ emaedaaña ekaa nnaaekọñ mbon Aram. Ammọ ekekewuọ mben nnaaekọñ, awo ndomokeed ikibaaha do, <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam mbon Aram ekop uyom mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara ye ekamba udịmekọñ, ado anam ammọ ebo emọ-emọ ete, “Se, adidem Isrel akpe mbon Hed ye mbon Iyib edinwana ye ñnyịn!” <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Ndin ammọ emaedaaña ke ndubi ado efeeñe enyʌñ ekpọñ mme nnaaekọñ ye mme enañmbakara ye mme dọñki ammọ. Ammọ emaekpọñ nnaaekọñ naña akeba enyʌñ efeeñe eyem uwem ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Ideen e-ekenieghe akpamfia emaekewuọ mben nnaaekọñ, emaedʌk keed ke atu mme atayad ado eta enyʌñ enwọñ. Ndin ammọ emaekoono silfa, kold ye mme afọñ, ekaa ekedịp ammọ. Akem ammọ emaetịmme edi enyʌñ edʌk atayad mfen ndin ekoono ñkpọ ke udo enyʌñ emaana ekedịp.<verse eid="2KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Ndin ammọ emaebo emọ-emọ, “Se ñnyịn inam inenne. Mfịn ado usen eti etob ndin ñnyịn inịm inọ idem ñnyịn. Adieke ñnyịn ibette nọ ayio asiere, ufen ayaisịm ñnyịn. Yak ika inikeed ikinọ mbʌk ami ke ufọkubọọñ adidem.”<verse eid="2KI 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Ndin ammọ emaekaa ekekoot mme akpeme inuaatob abio enyʌñ edọkkọ ammọ, “Ñnyịn imaikaa nnaaekọñ mbon Aram ndin awo ndomokeed ikibaaha do, uyom awo ndomokeed, sʌk mme enañmbakara ekeyịtte ye mme dọñki, mme atayad enyʌñ eba naña ekedaaña ekpọñ.” <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Mme akpeme inuaatob emaesio ñkpo ke etob ami, ndin emaesuan ke ufọk adidem.<verse eid="2KI 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Adidem amaadakka ada ke akonayio anyʌñ abo mme adaahaekọñ amọ, “Ami ñyaidọkkọ ndufo se mbon Aram inam ñnyịn. Ammọ ediọọñọ ke ñnyịn imikpa abiọọñ; ndin ammọ ekpọñ nnaaekọñ ammọ ekaa ekedịbe ke esịdidʌñ, ekere, ‘Ke akpanikọ ammọ eyaewuọñọ idi, ndin ñnyịn iyaimʌm ammọ ndisi inyʌñ idʌk abio.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Adaaha udịmekọñ keed amaabọọrọ, “Yak ideen edat enañmbakara ition asʌhọke ke abio. Mbaba ammọ adiiba nte ake afịd mbon Isrel e-ebaaha mi, ntoro, ammọ ediiba nte afịd mbon Isrel ake esoboke. Ndin yak ñnyịn idọñ ammọ yak eka ekediọọñọ me nsoo ikido.”<verse eid="2KI 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Ndin ammọ emaesio sariọd iba ye mme enañmbakara ammọ, ndin adidem amaadọñ ammọ ebịne udịmekọñ Aram. Anye amaanọ mme awaduwad uyio, “Ikaa inyʌñ iduuñọ idiọọñọ se ikitịppe.” <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Ammọ emaekeene ammọ tutu ekewuọ Yọdan, ndin ammọ emaekịt naña afịd usʌñ eyọhọ ye mme afọñ ye mme ñkpọekọñ a-mbon Aram eketoomoke eduọñọ idaha ammọ ekefeeñeke. Ndin mme isʌñutom emaenyọñ edi edidọkkọ adidem. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Ndin mme awo emaewuọ ekaa ekebịme ñkpọ ke nnaaekọñ mbon Aram. Ndin udomo ataa eti ndomuyo amaanyama ke sekel keed, ñko udomo baali iba amaanyama ke sekel keed, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ.<verse eid="2KI 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Ndin adidem amaanịm adaahaekọñ a-anye akebereke ke ubọk amọ ase ñkpọ abaña inuaatob, ndin mbon awo emaefiik anye ke atob, ndin anye amaakpa, kpa naña awo Abasi aketañ idaha adidem akediighe ufọk amọ. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Amaatịppe kpa naña awo Abasi akebo adidem: “Ñkpọñ idaha ntom, udomo ataa eti ndomuyo adiinyama ke sekel keed ndin udomo baali iba adiinyama ke sekel keed ke inuaatob Sameria.”<verse eid="2KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Adaahaekọñ amaabo awo Abasi, “Se, akpekọm <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpebeere mme inuaatob ke mme hefịn, utọ ñkpọ ntom akpaatịppe?” Awo Abasi amaabọọrọ, “Afo ayaakịt ke anyen mfo, ado uduudiaha ke esịd!” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Ndin ukem-ukem ami aketịppe anọ anye, sia mbon awo emaefiik anye ke inuaatob, ndin anye amaakpa.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eyaak Isọñ Awonwaan Sunam Enọ Anye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Ndin Elisa amaabo awonwaan Sunam a-anye akenamma nọ ayịn amọ awodeen amaana adu uwem, “Afo ye ufọk mfo ikpọñ umi diin inyʌñ ikaa ikiba ke itie mfen nte ekpekakan, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-abiide akañ ke isọñ ami a-adiikpeene ke isua itiaba.” <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Awonwaan ado amaanam kpa naña awo Abasi akebo. Anye ye ufọk amọ emaekpọñ ekedʌñ ke isọñ mbon Filistia isua itiaba.<verse eid="2KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Isua itiaba amaakeboiyo anye amaanyọñ ato isọñ Filistia adi, ndin adikikpeiye adidem abaña ufọk ye isọñ amọ. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Adidem akesʌk atañ ikọ ye Kehasi, ayịnufọk awo Abasi ado, ndin akebo, “Ndọkkọ miin mme ikpọ ñkpọ se Elisa anam.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Kpa idaha Kehasi akesʌkkọ adọkkọ adidem abaña naña Elisa akenam akpañkpa amaana adu uwem, awonwaan ake Elisa akenamma nọ ayịn amọ amaana adu uwem amaadi adidibeeñe adidem edibọ ufọk ye isọñ amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:5">Kehasi amaabo, “Awonwaan ado ado ami, abọọñ mmi adidem, ndin ayịn amọ awodeen E-Elisa akemaanake anam nọ adu uwem ado ami.” <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Adidem amaabịp awonwaan ado abaña ñkpọ ado, anye amaanyʌñ adọkkọ anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:6">Ndin anye amaanọ adaaha ase ñkpọ abaña ebeeñe amọ amaanyʌñ abo anye, “Nọ anye afịd ñkpọ se inie anye, ye udod isọñ amọ tọọñọ ke usen ake anye akekpọññọ idịd ami tutu idahami.”<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hasel Awot Ben-Hadad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Elisa amaakaa Damaskọs, ndin Ben-Hadad adidem Aram amaadọñọ. Emaedọkkọ adidem, “Awo Abasi adakka adi umi,” <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />anye amaabo Hasel, “Dat enọ kama ndin kaa ke soobo awo Abasi. Duuñọ to <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> to anye; bịp anye, ‘Ami ñyaabọkkọ udọñọ ami?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Hasel amaakesoobo Elisa, akama mme enọ ke kamel aba e-edọñọke ataa mfọọn nti usan ake Damaskọs. Anye amaakeda ke iso amọ, ndin amaabo, “Ayịn awodeen mfo Ben-Hadad adidem Aram andọñ miin yak ndibịp, ‘Ami ñyaabọkkọ udọñọ ami?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Elisa amaabọọrọ, “Kaa ke bo anye, ‘Ayaabọkkọ.’ Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaara annọ miin ke anye ayaakpa ke akpanikọ.” <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Anye amaawuuk anyen ase anye tutu abuud amʌm Hasael. Ndin awo Abasi atọọñọ itua.<verse eid="2KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Hasel amaabịp. “Nsoo ido nọ abọọñ mmi atua?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:12">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Sia ami mmediọọñọ ndoom a-afo uduunam ye mbon Isrel, afo ayaasịn ikañ ke mme ñkpọsọñ itie ammọ, a-awot ñkparawa ammọ ke akañkañ, a-atọ ntək nditọ ammọ ke isọñ, a-anyʌñ asai ibaan ammọ e-esañake ye idịb.”<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Hasel amaabo, “Afʌnadeen mfo, a-adooho ñkaña ewa, akpenam die anam utọ ekamba ñkpọ ami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:13">Elisa amaabọọrọ, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> añwọt miin ke afo ayaado adidem Aram.”<verse eid="2KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Ndin Hasel amaakpọñ Elisa anyọñ abịne eteufọk amọ. Ben-Hadad amaabịp anye, “Nsoo ke Elisa akudọkkọ fiin?” Hasael amaabọọrọ, “Anye amandọkkọ ke ayaabọkkọ ke akpanikọ.” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Ado edemusen anye amaadat ndodoppo afọñ, anyiin ke mmọọñ ndin atat anye afʌk ke iso adidem, ndin anye amaakpa. Ndin Hasel adat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoram Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Ke ayọhọ isua ition Yoram ayịn Ehab adidem Isrel, idaha Yehosafad akedooho adidem Yuda, Yehoram ayịn Yehosafad amaatọọñọ adikara nte adidem Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Anye akedo isua edịb mme duob mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua itiaita. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Anye amaakeene usʌñ mme ndidem Isrel, naña ufọk Ehab ekenam, sia amaadọ ayịn awonwaan Ehab. Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Kpayeado, ke ntak afʌnadeen amọ Defid, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikibeeñeke idem adisobo Yuda. Anye amaanwọñọ adinịm utuenikañ Defid ye ubon amọ ayama ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Ke ayio Yehoram, Edọm amaasọñ iwuod ye Yuda anyʌñ amek adidem anọ idem amọ. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Ndin Yehoram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoram asʌk ado ukem ye Yoram; se ñko ke 2 Nd 8:23 ye 24</char></note> amaakaa Saiye ye afịd sariọd amọ. Mbon Edọm emaekanna anye ye mme adaiso sariọd ekʌk, ado anye amaadakka ada afakka awuọ ke akonayio, ado udịmekọñ amọ emaefeeñe enyọñ ufọk. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Tutu awuọ usen mfịn Edọm aba ke nsọñiwuod ye Yuda. Libna amaanyʌñ anam nsọñiwuod ke ukem ini ado.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yehoram, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Yehoram amaaduọk adudu ye mme ete amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ye ammọ ke Abio Defid. Ndin Ahasaiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahasaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme iba ke ukara Yoram ayịn Ehab adidem Isrel, Ahasaiya ayịn Yehoram adidem Yuda amaatọọñọ adikara. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahasaiya akedo isua edịb mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua keed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Atalia, ayeyịn awonwaan Omri adidem Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Anye amaakeene ke usʌñ ufọk Ehab anyʌñ anam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, naña ufọk Ehab akenam, sia anye akedo ukod ke ufọk Ehab.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Ahasaiya amaakeene Yoram ayịn Ehab akaa ekọñ ye Hasel adidem Aram ke Ramọd Kilied. Mbon Aram emaenọ Yoram unan; <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />ndin adidem Yoram amaanyọñ akaa Yesriil adikisọbọ unan se mbon Aram ekenọọ anye ke Ramọd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Ramọd asʌk ado ukem ye Rama</char></note> ke ekọñ amọ ye Hasel adidem Aram.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:29">Ndin Ahasaiya ayịn Yehoram adidem Yuda amaakaa Yesriil adikikịt Yoram ayịn Ehab, sia emaenọ anye unan.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Eyet Yehu Adan Nte Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Prọfed Elisa amaakoot awodeen ke atu nditọ mme prọfed ndin abo anye, “Nuuk afọñ mfo dọñ ke ñkpaha mfo, ben atu adan ọlif ami nyʌñ kaa Ramọd Kilied. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Umaukuwuọ do, yem Yehu ayịn Yehosafad, ayịn Nimsi. Kaa bịne anye, dat anye sio kpọñ mme nsaña amọ ndin dat anye dʌk esịd-esịd ubeed. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Ndin ben atu ado nyʌñ duọk adan ke iwuod amọ ndin bo, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ami mmuyet fiin adan nte adidem Isrel.’ Ndin beere usʌñ nyʌñ feghe; kuubiat ini!”<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Ndin etək prọfed amaakaa Ramọd Kilied. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Anye akekewuọ, anye amaakịt ikpọ mbon ekọñ naña etie keed. Anye amaabo, “Ami mmenie etob unọ fiin, adaiso ekọñ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Yehu amaabịp abo, “Anie ke atu ñnyịn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Unie fiin, Adaiso,”<verse eid="2KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Yehu amaadakka ada anyʌñ adʌk ufọk. Ndin prọfed amaaduọk adan ke iwuod Yehu ndin abo, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo: ‘Ami mmuyet fiin adan nọ ado adidem mbon <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Ana afo asobo ufọk Ehab eteufọk mfo, ndin ami ñyaasio usiene iyiib mme isʌñutom mmi mme prọfed ye iyiib afịd nditọufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ake Yesibeel akeduọkkọ. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Afịd ufọk Ehab ayaatak. Ami ñyaawot afịd akpatre awodeen ke Isrel nsio ke Ehab, a-adooho afʌn me amanaisọñ. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Ami ñyaanam ufọk Ehab atie nte ufọk Yerobuam ayịn Nebad ye nte ufọk Baasa ayịn Ahiya. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Amaado Yesibeel, mme ewa ediita anye ke ñkpịkke isọñ ke Yesriil, ndin awo ndomokeed idiibuuho anye.’ ” Ndin anye amaabeere usʌñ anyʌñ afeghe.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Ke ini Yehu akewuọhọ abịne mme emọ-emọ etubom udịmekọñ, keed ke atu ado amaabịp anye, “Nte afịd ñkpọ a-afọn ama? Ntak idaad ami adiighe ubịne fiin-e?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:11">Yehu amaabọọrọ, “Afo amediọọñọ awo ami ye mme utọ ñkpọ se anye asitañ,”<verse eid="2KI 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Ammọ emaebo, “Idooho akpanikọ! Idọkkọ ñnyịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">Yehu amaabo, “Se anye akendọkkọ adom: ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ami mmuyet fiin adan nọ ado adidem Isrel.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Ammọ emaesọsọp eben afọñ ammọ ebịt ke ukpọk udodukod. Ndin ammọ emaefịt adukpoñ emaenyʌñ esio ñkpo, “Yehu ado adidem!”<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu Awot Yọram ye Ahasaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Ndin Yehu ayịn Yehosafad, ayịn Nimsi, edʌk edioomo ebaña Yoram. (Ndin Yoram ye afịd Isrel ekesʌk ekpeme Ramọd Kilied ke ntak Hasel adidem Aram, <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />ado Adidem Yoram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoram asʌk ado ukem ye Yoram; se ñko ke 2 Nd 3:6</char></note> amaanyọñ akaa Yesriil nọ akesọbọ unan mbon Aram ekenọọhọ anye ke anwan ye Hasel adidem Aram.) Yehu amaabo, “Adieke ndufo eyemme edinnam miin adidem, ikiiyak awo ndomokeed abọkkọ awuọ ke abio aben mbʌk aketañ ke Yesriil.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Ndin Yehu amaadʌk sariọd ndin amaawat akaa Yesriil, sia Yoram akeduọk adudu do ndin Ahasaiya adidem Yuda amaakaa adikise anye.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Ke ini akpeme abio a-akedaaha ke anyọñ tọwa ke Yesriil akekịtte udịmekọñ Yehu naña edi, anye amaakoot abo, “Ami mmekịt naña udịmekọñ edi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Yoram anọ uyio, “Dat awad enañmbakara,” “Dọñ anye abịne ammọ anyʌñ abịp, ‘Edi ke emem?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Awad enañmbakara amaawat akesoobo Yehu ndin amaabo, “Ntom ke adidem abo: ‘Nte afo adi ke emem?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Yehu amaabọọrọ. “Nsoo ido ndubeghe mfo ye emem? Dʌk edem mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Akpeme abio amaadọkkọ, “Isʌñutom asịm ammọ, ado anye itịmmeke idi.”<verse eid="2KI 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Ndin adidem amaadọñ ayọhọ awad enañmbakara iba. Anye akedisịm ammọ anye amaabo, “Ntom ke adidem abo: ‘Edi ke emem?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:19">Yehu amaabọọrọ, “Nsoo ido ndubeghe mfo ye emem? Dʌk ke edem mmi.”<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Akpeme abio amaadọkkọ, “Anye amaasịm ammọ, ado anye inyʌññọ itịmme idi. Uwad atie nte uwad Yehu ayịn Nimsi, anye awat nte idaad.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Yọram amaanọ uyio abo. “Sio sariọd mmi di,” Ndin ke emaekesio anye edi, Yoram adidem Isrel ye Ahasaiya adidem Yuda emaewat ewuọ, anie sariọd amọ anie, edikisoobo Yehu. Ammọ emaesoobo anye ke itie isọñ a-akenieghe Nabọd awo Yesriil. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Yoram akekịt Yehu anye amaabịp, “Afo adi ke emem, Yehu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">Yehu amaabọọrọ, “Emem akpekan die aba,” “nte afịd ukpono ndem ye ifọd eka mfo Yesibeel ayọhọke isọñ?”<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Yoram amaakanna iso ndin amaafeghe, ada akoot Ahasaiya, “Abiaña, Ahasaiya!”<verse eid="2KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Ndin Yehu amaadʌt utịgha amọ atịgha Yoram ke ufọọd afara. Utịgha ado amaakịm anye esịd ndin anye amaanyʌkkọ ke sariọd amọ. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Yehu amaabo Bidka, etubom sariọd amọ, “Dịppe anye ke anyọñ nyʌñ top anye sịn ke inwañ a-akenieghe Nabọd awo Yesriil. Toiyo naña afo ye ami ikiwat keed ke mme sariọd ke edem Ehab ete amọ idaha <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ñkukịd ami abaña anye: <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />‘Ñkpọñ ami mmaakịt iyiib Nabọd ye iyiib nditọ ideen amọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, ndin ke akpanikọ ami ñyaanam afo akpe utịb ke itie isọñ ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.’ Ndin dịppe anye nyʌñ top anye sịn ke itie isọñ, nọ asaña akekem ye ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Ke ini Ahasaiya adidem Yuda akekịtte se ikitịppe, anye amaafeghe adʌk usʌñ a-akaaha Bed Hakkan. Yehu amaabịne anye, abọñ ñkpo, “Wot anye ñko!” Ammọ emaenọ anye unan ke sariọd amọ ke usʌñ a-akaaha Kọọ a-akpereke Ibleem, ado anye amaabọkkọ afeghe akaa Mekido anyʌñ akekpa do. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Nditọufọk amọ emaeben anye ke sariọd eka Yeruselem emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ye mme eteete amọ ke Abio Defid. <verse eid="2KI 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />(Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme keed ukara Yoram ayịn Ehab, Ahasaiya amaado adidem Yuda.)<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Yesibeel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Ndin Yehu amaakaa Yesriil. Yesibeel akekop abaña ami, anye amaadeppe anyen, anam ided amọ anyʌñ anyan iso asio ke ubenafịm. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Yehu akedʌk inuaatob, anye amaabịp, “Afo adi ke emem, afo Simri, afo a-awotto eteufọk mfo?”<verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Anye amaadịppe iso ase ubenafịm anyʌñ akoot, “Anie iba ke ñkañ mmi? Anie?” Mme itọ iba me ita emaesuuk iso ese anye. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Yehu amaabo, “Top anye duọọk!” Ndin ammọ emaetop anye eduọọk ke isọñ, ndin ubaak iyiib amọ amaatiamma ke ndibene ndin mme enañmbakara emaefiik anye ke ñkpad.<verse eid="2KI 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Yehu amaadʌk akedia anyʌñ anwọñ. Anye amaabo, “Nam ñkpọ baña awonwaan isuuñọ ado, ndin ebuuk anye, sia anye akedo ayịn awonwaan adidem.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Ado ammọ ekeka edibuuk anye, awo ikikịtte ñkpọ ndomokeed ibọhọke ñkpọkpọrọ amọ, ukod amọ ye ubọk amọ. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Ammọ emaetịmme ekedọkkọ Yehu, a-akebooho, “Ami ado ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ato afʌnadeen amọ Elaiya awo Tisbe: Ke itie isọñ ke Yesriil mme ewa eyaeta abʌk Yesibeel. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Idem Yesibeel adiiba nte uduañ ke isọñ ke Yesriil, mbaak awo ndomokeed adikan abo, ‘Yesibeel adom.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ewot Mbon Ufọk Ehab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Ndin ke Sameria amaaba nditọ ideen ata mme duob e-eketooho ufọk Ehab. Ndin Yehu amaawet mme ñwed anọ eka Sameria: esọk mme adaaha Yesriil, esọk mme ñkpisọñ ye mme akpeme nditọ Ehab. Anye amaabo, <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Ndufo emekama nditọ ideen eteufọk ndufo, ndin emenie mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara, abio esọọñọke ye mme ñkpọ ekọñ. Ñwedetob ami amaasʌk isịm ndufo, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />imek ke atu nditọ ideen eteufọk ndufo mbon se ifọn ikan inyʌñ idot ikan inyʌñ idot anye ke ebekpo ete amọ. Ndin inwana ke ntak ufọk eteufọk ndufo.”<verse eid="2KI 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Ado ammọ emaekop ndịk ndin emaebo, “Adieke ndidem iba imiikikanna anye, ñnyịn idiinam die ikan?”<verse eid="2KI 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Ndin mme ase ñkpọ mbaña ufọkadidem, mme adaaha abio, mme ñkpisọñ ye mme akpeme nditọ emaedọñ etob ami esọk Yehu: “Ñnyịn ido nditọufọk mfo ndin ñnyịn iyainam ñkpọ akeedodo a-afo abooho. Ñnyịn idiimekke awo ndomokeed nte adidem; afo nam se afo akere ke afọn.”<verse eid="2KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Ndin Yehu amaawet ammọ ayọhọ ñwed iba, ate, “Adieke ndufo ebaaha ke ñkañ mmi enyʌñ ekop ikọ mmi, idat mme iwuod nditọ ideen eteufọk ndufo ndin idiñkịt miin ke Yesriil ñkpọñ idaha ntom.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Ndin mme nditọ ideen adidem, ata mme duob, ekeba ye mme ikpọawo ke abio, e-ekebọọhọ ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Ke ini ñwedetob ado amaakedisịm, ibon ami emaekoono mme nditọ ideen adidem ewot afịd ammọ awo ata mme duob ado. Ammọ emaedọñ iwuod ammọ ke akpasa enyʌñ enọ esọk Yehu ke Yesriil. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Isʌñutom akediwuọ, anye amaadọkkọ Yehu, “Eben mme iwuod nditọ ideen adidem edi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:8">Ndin Yehu amaanọ uyio, “Bon ammọ ke eboho iba ke inuaatob abio tutu ubakusen.”<verse eid="2KI 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Ubakusen edemusen Yehu amaawuọ. Anye amaada ke iso afịd awo ndin amaabo, “Ndufo idueghe. Ado ami ñkedioomo mbaña eteufọk mmi ñnyʌñ ñwot anye, ado anie ikiwot afịd mbio ami? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Idiọọñọ ndin, ke ibaaha ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ abaña ufọk Ehab adiikpu. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam se anye aketañ ke uyio afʌnadeen amọ Elaiya.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Ndin Yehu amaawot afịd awo ke Yesriil se ikisʌhọ ke ufọk Ehab, ye afịd mme etubom amọ, mme akpan ufan amọ ye mme aku amọ, isʌhọke awo ndomokeed inọ anye.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Ndin Yehu amaadakka akaa Sameria. Ke Bed Eked mme Akpemeedọñ, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />Yehu amaasoobo mme ayakka Ahasaiya adidem Yuda amaanyʌñ abịp, “Ndufo edo mme anie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:13">Ammọ emaebo, “Ñnyịn ido mme ayakka Ahasaiya, ndin ñnyịn imidi edikọọm mme ufọk adidem ye eka anwaan adidem.”<verse eid="2KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Anye amaanọ uyio, “Imʌm ammọ ye uwem!” Ndin emaeben ammọ ye uwem ekeyọi ammọ ke udu ke Bed Eked, ammọ awo aba mme iba. Anye ikinịmme nsʌhọ ndomokeed.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Anye akekpọñ udo, anye amaakịt Yehonadab ayịn Rekab, akediighe adisoobo ye anye. Yehu amaakọọm anye ndin amaabo, “Afo amenen esịd ye ami, naña ami mba ye afo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Yehonadab amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmenem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">“Akpedo ntoro,” Yehu amaabo, “nnọ ubọk mfo.” Anye amaanọ anye ubọk, ndin Yehu amaanwam anye adọọk adʌk sariọd. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Yehu amaabo, “Di ye ami nyʌñ di se ufịb ake ami mfịbeke nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” Ndin anye amaanam anye awat ye anye ke sariọd amọ.<verse eid="2KI 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Yehu akediwuọ Sameria, anye amaawot afịd awo se ikisʌhọ ke ufọk Ehab; anye amaasobo ammọ, akeene ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña anọ Elaiya.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Nditọufọk Baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Ndin Yehu amaakoot afịd awo abon itie keed ndin amaabo ammọ, “Ehab amaanam ñkpọ anọ Baal etək-etək; Yehu ayaanam ñkpọ anọ anye ekamba-ekamba. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Ndin ikoot afịd mme prọfed Baal, afịd nditọufọk amọ ye afịd mme aku amọ. Ikịt ebo ke ndomokeed isʌhọke, sia ami ñyaanam ekamba uwa nnọ Baal. Awo ndomokeed a-atịmmeke idiiduuho uwem aba.” Ado Yehu akenam ñkara nọ anye asobo nditọufọk Baal.<verse eid="2KI 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Yehu amaabo, “Ikoot mbono ke ukpono Baal.” Ndin ammọ emaenọ etob. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Ndin Yehu amaadọñ etob ke afịd Isrel, ndin afịd nditọufọk e-ekponoke Baal emaewuọñọ edi; ndomokeed ikitịmmeke. Ammọ emaefaha edọñọ tembịd Baal tutu anye ayọhọ tọọñọ ke mbeñ keed tutu awuọ mbeñ uko. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Ndin Yehu amaabo aseñkpọ mbaña afọñ, “Koono afọñ sọk afịd nditọufọk Baal.” Ndin anye amaakoono afọñ anọ ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Ndin Yehu ye Yehonadab ayịn Rekab emaedʌk tembịd Baal. Yehu amaabo nditọufọk Baal, “Ikịt ibo ke awo ndomokeed a-akponoke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibaaha mi ye ndufo, yak ado nditọufọk Baal kpọd.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Ndin ammọ emaedʌk ekaa edinam mme uwa ye mme ufọfọb uwa. Ndin Yehu amaadaaha ideen anaañ ke anwa ye ewʌhọ ami: “Adieke keed ke atu ndufo eyakka awodeen ndomokeed ami nsịnne ke ubọk ndufo abọkkọ, adiido uwem mfo ke ake amọ.”<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Yehu akesʌk ananam ufọfọb uwa ama, anye amaabo mbon ukpeme ye mbon ekọñ: “Idʌk ikaa ikiwot ammọ; ikiiyak awo ndomokeed abọkkọ.” Ndin ammọ emaekpook ammọ ke akañkañ. Mbon ukpeme ye mbon ekọñ emaetoomo akpo ammọ eduọọk enyʌñ edọñọ esịd ñwommo tembịd Baal. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Ammọ emaeben asaña-asaña itiad esio ke tembịd Baal enyʌñ efọp anye. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Emaewuut asaña-asaña itiad Baal enyʌñ ewuut tembịd Baal, ndin mbon awo emaedat anye enam itie ukaikọd tutu usen mfịn ami.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Ndin Yehu amaasobo ukpono Baal ke Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Ado, Yehu ikiwọññọke ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, ake anye akenamma Isrel anam, adikpono mme ubobod ñyịn enañ ke Beteel ye Daan.<verse eid="2KI 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yehu, “Sia afo amenam afọn ke adinam se inen ke anyen mmi anyʌñ anam ye ufọk Ehab afịd se ami ñkenie ke akikere adinam, mbon ubon mfo eyaetie ke ebekpo Isrel tutu ayọhọ emana inaañ.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Ado Yehu ikikpemeke adinịm mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ke afịd esịd amọ. Anye ikiwọññọke ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam, ake anye akenamma nọ Isrel anam.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Ke ini ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatọọñọ adinam ndaha Isrel asịp. Hasel amaakan mbon Isrel ke afịd idịd ammọ <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />ke usakkautịn Yọdan ke afịd isọñ Kilied (efaak Kad, Rubịn ye Manase), tọọñọ ke Arowa ke mben Abedeñ Anọn tutu Kilied akewuọ Basan.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Amaado mme ñkpọ se ikitịppe ke ukara Yehu, afịd se anye akenam, ye afịd edinam amọ, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel?<verse eid="2KI 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Yehu amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Sameria. Ndin Yehoahas ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Ini Yehu akekarake Isrel ke Sameria akedo isua edịb mme itiaita.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Atalia ye Yoas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Atalia eka Ahasaiya amaakekịt ke ayịn imọ amaakpa, anye amaadakka akesobo afịd mbon ufọk adidem. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Ado Yehoseba, ayịn awonwaan Adidem Yehoram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoram asʌk ado ukem ye Yoram; se ñko ke 2 Nd 3:6</char></note> ye ayịneka awonwaan Ahasaiya, amaaben Yoas ayịn Ahasaiya anyʌñ ayịp anye asio ke atu mme nditọ ideen adidem ke ufọk ubọọñ a-akenaaha nte ewoot. Anye amaasịn anye ye adeb amọ ke esịd ubeed adidịp anye mbaak Atalia; ke ntak ado awo ikiwotto anye. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Anye amaakaa iso adịbe ye adeb amọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke isua itiokeed ke idaha ini Atalia akekarake abio.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Ke ayọhọ isua itiaba Yehoiyada amaadọñ ekoot mme adaiso udịmekọñ ke mme ikpeghe ikie ikie (100), mbon Kaa ye mbon ukpeme ndin amaaben ammọ adi ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye amaanam edioomo ye ammọ anyʌñ anọ ammọ unwọñọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ndin anye amaawọt ammọ ayịn adidem. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Anye amaanọ ammọ ewʌhọ ate, “Se ndufo ediinam ado ami: Ndufo e-ebaaha ke ikpeghe ita ediiba ke utom ke Sabad, mbakka keed ke itie ita ekpemeke ufọk ubọọñ adidem, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />mbakka keed ke itie ita ke Inuaatob Suu, ndin mbakka keed ke itie ita ke inuaatob ke edem mbon ukpeme, ekpemeke tembịd ke ini ke ini, <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />ndin ndufo e-ebaaha ke mme ikpeghe iba ako ammiisibaaha ke utom ke Sabad ana ekpeme tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ adidem. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Ndufo idudak ikanna adidem ikʌk, awo keed ye ñkpọekọñ amọ ke ubọk. Ana ewot awo ndomokeed ake asañake ikpere ndufo. Idiana adidem ke idem itie nte anye akaka.”<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Mme adaiso udịmekọñ ikie emaenam kpa ukem-ukem naña aku Yehoiyada akenọọ uyio. Etubom keedekeed amaaben ideen amọ, mbon e-ekekaahaka utom ke Sabad ye mbon e-ekenyọñọkenyọñọ ke utom, enyʌñ edi ebịne aku Yehoiyada. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Ndin anye amaanọ mme adaiso ekọñ mme eduad ye atuekọñ a-Adidem Defid akenieghe, e-ekenyʌññọ ebono ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Mbon ukpeme, awo keedekeed ye ñkpọekọñ ke ubọk, emaeda ekanna adidem, ekpere akpokoro uwa ye tembịd, tọọñọ ke ñkañ usuuk tutu ñkañ adoro tembịd.<verse eid="2KI 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Yehoiyada amaasio ayịn awodeen adidem adi anyʌñ ayat anye anyanya; anye amaanọ anye ñwed edioomo anyʌñ asọọñọ atañ ke anye ado adidem. Ammọ emaeyet anye adan, ndin mbon awo emaekwak ubọk enyʌñ ekpọk ukịbe ete, “Itọñ uwem asọñ adidem!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Atalia akekop uyom a-mbon ukpeme ye mbon awo ekenamma, anye amaadakka abịne mbon awo ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Anye amaase anyʌñ akịt ke adidem mmọdo akeda adiana abai, naña ido akesido. Mme etubom ye mme afịd adukpoñ emaeda ye adidem, ndin afịd awo ke abio ekesʌk edaara enyʌñ efịt mme adukpoñ. Ndin Atalia amaawai afọñidem amọ ndin amaasio ñkpo ate, “Abiaña! Abiaña!”<verse eid="2KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Aku Yehoiyada amaanọ mme adaiso udịmekọñ ake mme ikpeghe ikie, e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña udịmekọñ uyio ate: “Isio anye ke atu mbon awo ndin iwot awo ndomokeed a-akeeneke anye ke akañkañ.” Sia aku amaabo, “Inaaha ewot anye ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Ndin ammọ emaemʌm anye ke idaha anye akewuọhọ inuausʌñ ake mme enañ esidʌkkọ akwere ufọk adidem, ndin emaenyʌñ ewot anye ke itie ado.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Ndin Yehoiyada amaanam edioomo ke ufọọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye adidem ye mbon awo ke ammọ eyaedo mbon <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye ñko amaamaana anam edioomo ke ufọọd adidem ye mbon awo. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Afịd awo ke isọñ emaekaa enyʌñ ekewuut tembịd Baal. Ammọ emaeboom mme akpokoro uwa ye mme ubobodñkpọ enyʌñ ewot Matan aku Baal ke iso mme akpokoro uwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 11:18">Ndin aku Yehoiyada amaadaaha mbon ukpeme ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Anye amaaben mme adaiso udịmekọñ ikie, mbon Kaa, mbon ukpeme ye afịd awo ke abio, ndin afịd awo emaeben adidem edi tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ edʌk ufọkadidem, eto inuaatob mbon ukpeme edʌk. Ndin adidem amaadat itie amọ ke ebekpo ubọọñ. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Afịd awo ke isọñ emaedaara, ndin abio amaadobo, sia emaewot Atalia ke akañkañ ke ufọk adidem.<verse eid="2KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Yoas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoas asʌk ado ukem ye Yoas; se ñko ke 2 Nd 3:6</char></note> akedo isua itiaba idaha anye aketọọñọke adikara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ewet 2 Nd 11:21 nte 2 Nd 12:1</char></note>.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yoas Adiọñ Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru ewet 2 Nd 12:1-21 nte 2 Nd 12:2-22</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua itiaba ke ukara Yehu, Yoas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoas asʌk ado ukem ye Yoas; se ñko ke 2 Nd 12:2, 4, 6, 7 ye 18 </char></note> amaado adidem, ndin anye amaakaara ke Yeruselem isua aba. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Sibia; anye aketo Beeseba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Yoas amaanam se inen ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd isua se aku Yehoiyada aketemme anye. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Ado, awo ikiwuudo mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie; mbon awo ekesʌk ekaka iso enam mme uwa enyʌñ efọp insensi ke ndo.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Yoas amaabo mme aku, “Ikoono afịd akʌk e-ebenne edi nte adisana enọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akʌk e-ekebọọhọ ke ubadawo, akʌk e-ekebọọhọ eto akaaña ake mme awo ekenamma ye akʌk enọ imaesịd e-ekebenne edi tembịd. <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />Yak aku keedekeed abọ akʌk ato keed ke atu mme akamaakʌk, ndin aben adiọñ ñkpọ se ibiara ke tembịd.”<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Ado ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme ita ke ukara Adidem Yoas mme aku ikisʌkkọ idọdiọñ tembịd. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Ke ntoro Adidem Yoas amaakoot aku Yehoiyada ye mme aku mfen ndin amaabịp ammọ, “Nsoo ido ndufo idiọññọ se ibiara ke tembịd? Ikiibọọ akʌk aba ito mme akamaakʌk ndufo, ado iyaak inọ nọ edat ediọñ tembịd.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Mme aku emaenyịmme ke mmimọ idiibọọhọ aba akʌk ito mbon awo ñko ke mmimọ idiidiọññọ tembịd ke idem mmimọ.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Aku Yehoiyada amaaben akebe atịppe adudu ke ukʌb amọ. Anye amaanịm anye ke mben akpokoro uwa, ke ubọk nnasia ke awo adʌkkọ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Mme aku ake ekekpemeke anyenusʌñ emaesịn afịd akʌk se ekeben edi tembịd ke akebe ado. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Ini akeedodo ammọ emaekịt ke akʌk awak ke akebe ado, awedñwed adidem ye ekamba aku emaedi, edibat akʌk ekebenne edi tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin edọñ ke mme ekpad. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Ke emaediọọñọ ibad akʌk, ammọ emaenọ ideen ekebooho ese utom ke tembịd akʌk. Emaekama akʌk ado ekpe mbon se ikinam utom ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mme akọñeto ye mme abọbufọk, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />mme akọọkufọk ye mme akpịkke itiad. Ammọ emaedep eto ye udọdiọñ itiad se ekama ediọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, emaenyʌñ ekpe akʌk akem afịd mme ñkpọ se ekedat ediọñ tembịd.<verse eid="2KI 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Awo ikikamake akʌk se ekeben edi tembịd inam mme besịn silfa, mme ufadikañ, mme usan usiime ñkpọ, mme adukpoñ ye mme ñkpọ kold me silfa mfen ediinịm ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />ekekpe enọ mbon utom, e-ekedatta ediọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Ammọ ikiyemme mbon se ekenọọ akʌk ebo ekpe mbon utom edinam ibad sia ammọ emaenam akpanikọ ke afịd ñkpọ. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Awo ikibenne akʌk aketooho mme uwa ndudue ye uwa idiọọkñkpọ idʌk tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; akenie mme aku.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Ke idaha ado Hasel adidem Aram amaakaa akenwana ye Kad anyʌñ adat anye. Ndin anye amaawọññọ akaa adinwana ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Ado Yoas adidem Yuda amaakoono afịd mme ndisana ñkpoduoho a-mme eteete amọ ekediọññọ, Yehosafad, Yehoram ye Ahasaiya, mme ndidem Yuda, ye mme enọ a-anye ke idem amọ akediọññọ ye afịd kold e-ekekịtte ke itie unịmñkpọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ufọkadidem ubọọñ, ndin anye amaanọ esọk Hasel adidem Aram, ndin anye amaatịmme akpọñ Yeruselem.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yoas, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Mme adaaha amọ emaedʌk edioomo ebaña Yoas enyʌñ ewot anye ke Bed Milo, ke usʌñ e-etịkkeke eka Sila. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Mme adaaha e-ekewotto anye ekedo Yoosabad ayịn Simied ye Yehosabad ayịn Soma. Anye amaakpa emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ye mme eteete amọ ke Abio Defid. Ndin Amasaiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yehoahas Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme ita ke ukara Yoas ayịn Ahasaiya adidem Yuda, Yehoahas ayịn Yehu amaado adidem Isrel ke Sameria, ndin anye amaakara isua duob mme itiaba. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke edikeene mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, anye akenamma Isrel enam, ndin anye ikiwọññọke ikpọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Ndin iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakeene Isrel, ndin ke anyan ini anye amaasịn ammọ ke idak adudu Hasel adidem Aram ye Ben-Hadad ayịn amọ.<verse eid="2KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Ndin Yehoahas amaayem mfọn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpañ utọñ anọ anye, sia anye amaakịt naña adidem Aram akefʌnnọ Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasio andinyaaña anọ Isrel, ndin ammọ emaebọkkọ ke adudu Aram. Ndin Isrel emaedʌñ ke mme atʌñ ammọ naña akesidak ado. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Ado ammọ ikiwọññọke ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ ufọk Yerobuam, ake anye akenamma Isrel anam; ammọ emaekaa iso enam. Ñko, abai Asera akesʌk adada ke Sameria.<verse eid="2KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Ñkpọ ndomokeed ikisʌhọke a-akenieghe udịmekọñ Yehoahas imiibọhọke mme awad enañmbakara aba mme duob, sariọd duob ye mme anwanaekọñ tọsịn duob, sia adidem Aram amaasobo mbon ako anyʌñ anam ammọ eba nte ntọñ itie ukọkñkpọ.<verse eid="2KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yehoahas, afịd se anye akenam ye ukeme amọ, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Yehoahas amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Sameria. Ndin Yehoas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoas asʌk ado ukem ye Yoas; se ñko ke 2 Nd 13:12-14 ye 25</char></note> ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoas Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme itiaba ke ukara Yoas adidem Yuda, Yehoas ayịn Yehoahas amaado adidem Isrel ke Sameria, ndin anye amaakara isua duob mme itiokeed. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikinyʌññọ iwọññọ ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, ake anye akenamma yak mbon Isrel enam; ado anye amaakaa iso anam.<verse eid="2KI 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yehoas, afịd se anye akenam ye mme utom amọ, ye anwan amọ ye Amasaiya adidem Yuda, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Yehoas amaakeduọk adudu, ndin Yerobuam amaadat itie amọ ke ebekpo. Emaebuuk Yehoas ke Sameria ye mme ndidem Isrel.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Ndin Elisa akesʌk adọdọñọ ye udọñọ a-akedatta uwem amọ. Yehoas adidem Isrel amaakaa akese anye anyʌñ atua abaña anye. Anye amaatua, “Ete mmi! Ete mmi! Mme sariọd ye mme awad enañmbakara Isrel!”<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Elisa amaabo, “Dat idañ ye mme utịgha,” anye amaanyʌñ anam ntoro. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Anye amaabo adidem Isrel, “Dat idañ ke ubọk mfo. Ke ini anye amaakenam ntoro, Elisa amaasịn ubọk amọ ke ubọk adidem.<verse eid="2KI 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />“Beere ubenafịm edem usakkautịn,” anye amaabo, ndin anye amaabeere anye. Elisa amaabo, “Tịgha!” ndin anye amaatịgha. Elisa amaabo, “Utịgha adikan <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, utịgha adikan Aram! Afo ayaasobo afịd mbon Aram e-ebaaha ke Afek.”<verse eid="2KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Ndin anye amaabo, “Koono mme utịgha ado,” ndin adidem amaakoono ammọ. Elisa amaabo adidem Isrel, “Yʌppọ isọñ.” Anye amaayʌppọ anye akañ ita ndin atre. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Awo Abasi amaayat esịd ye anye ndin amaabo. “Akpekena afo ayʌppọ isọñ akañ ition me akañ itiokeed; ndin afo akpaakekan Aram a-anyʌñ asobo anye afịd-afịd. Ado idahami afo uduukan anye akañ ita kpọd.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Elisa amaakpa emaenyʌñ ebuuk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 13:20">Ndin mbon utaññkpọ Mọb emaesidʌk idịd afịd ini utọ. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Inikeed idaha ake mbon Isrel ekesʌkkọ ebuuk ete keed, inikeed ammọ emaekịt udịm mbon utaññkpọ; ndin ammọ emaetop akpo ete ado esịn ke udi Elisa. Akpo ete ado aketuuk akpọ Elisa, ndin ete ado amaaset anyʌñ adakka ada ke ukod amọ.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Hasel adidem Aram amaafʌnnọ Isrel ke afịd ini ukara Yehoahas. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaafọn ido ye ammọ anyʌñ atua ammọ mbọm anyʌñ awọt ke imikere ibaña ammọ ke ntak edioomo amọ ye Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb. Tutu usen mfịn anye ibeeñeke idem adisobo ammọ me adibịne ammọ nsio ke iso amọ.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Hasel adidem Aram amaakpa, ndin Ben-Hadad ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Ndin Yehoas ayịn Yehoahas amaamaana abọi ato Ben-Hadad ayịn Hasel mme abio se anye akebọi ke ekọñ ato ete amọ Yehoahas. Yehoas amaakan anye akañ ita, anye amaanyʌñ abọi mme abio Isrel.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Amasaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua iba ke ukara Yehoas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Yehoas asʌk ado ukem ye Yoas; se ñko ke 2 Nd 14:13, 23 ye 27</char></note> ayịn Yehoahas adidem Isrel, Amasaiya ayịn Yoas adidem Yuda amaatọọñọ adikara. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Anye akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme usʌkkeed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Yehoadan; eka amọ aketo Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Anye amaanam se ikinen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado ikidooho naña ete amọ Defid akenam. Ke afịd ñkpọ anye akekeene uwọdñkpọ ete amọ Yoas. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Ado, awo ikiwuudo mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie; mbon awo ekesʌk ekaka iso enam mme uwa enyʌñ efọp insensi ke ndo.<verse eid="2KI 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Ke anye amaakesọọñọ amʌm itie ukara akama, anye amaawoot mme adaaha e-ekewotto ete amọ adidem. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Kpayeado anye ikiwotto nditọ mbon e-ekewotto ete amọ, akeene se ekewet ke Ñwed Mbed Moses a-adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo: “Mme ete ye mme eka idiikpaaha ke ntak nditọ ammọ, nditọ ñko idiikpaaha ke ntak mme ete ye mme eka ammọ; awo keedekeed adiikpa ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ amọ.”<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Anye ado awo a-akewotto mbon Edọm awo tọsịn duob ke Abedeñ Inʌñ anyʌñ adat Sela ke ekọñ, anọ anye anyịñ Yokteel, anyịñ anye akereke tutu awuọ mfịn ami.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Ndin Amasaiya amaadọñ mme isʌñutom anọ Yehoas ayịn Yehoahas, ayịn Yehu, adidem Isrel, ye ñnyanubọk: “Di, yak ñnyịn inwana emọ-emọ ke ekọñ iso ye iso.”<verse eid="2KI 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Ado Yehoas adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ Amasaiya adidem Yuda: “Mbaraekpe keed ke Lebanọn amaadọñ utom anọ sida ke Lebanọn, ‘Ben ayịn awonwaan mfo nọ ayịn mmi ke ndọ.’ Ndin idiọọk unamikọd ke Lebanọn amaadi adisọnnọ mbaraekpe ke ukod. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Ke akpanikọ amekan Edọm ke ekọñ ndin idahami amekokko idem. Dia ubọọñ ke edikan mfo, ado sịne ke ufọk! Ntak afo ayemme mfịna anyʌñ adat iduọ asọk idem mfo ye Yuda ñko-o?”<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Ado Amasaiya ikiikamma ikpañ utọñ, ndin Yehoas adidem Isrel amaatop ekọñ ye anye. Anye ye Ahasaiya adidem Yuda emaenwana emọ-emọ iso ye iso ke Bed Semes ke Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Isrel amaakan Yuda, ndin afịd awo emaefeeñe enyọñọ ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Yehoas adidem Isrel amaamʌm Amasaiya adidem Yuda, ayịn Yoas, ayịn Ahasaiya, ke Bed Semes. Ndin Yehoas amaakaa Yeruselem akewuut ndibene Yeruselem tọọñọ ke Inuaatob Ifrem tutu akewuọ Inuaatob Inuuk, ikpeghe akenyọọñọ ñkpọ nte kubid ikie inaañ (400)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte mita 180</char></note>. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Anye amaakoono afịd kold ye silfa ye mme ñkpọ ekekịtte ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke mme itie ubono inie ufọkadidem ubọọñ. Anye amaanyʌñ akoono mme mbon awo ntañmfeb anyọñ akaa Sameria.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yehoas, se anye akenam ye mme ñkpọ se anye akenam anịm, ye ekọñ anye akenwanake ye Amasaiya adidem Yuda, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yehoas amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ enyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Sameria ye mme ndidem Isrel. Ndin Yerobuam ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Amasaiya ayịn Yoas adidem Yuda amaadu uwem isua duob mme ition ke Yehoas ayịn Yehoahas adidem Isrel amaakekpa. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ini ukara Amasaiya, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda?<verse eid="2KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Ammọ emaedʌk idiọọk edioomo ebaña anye ke Yeruselem, ndin anye amaafeghe akaa Lakis, ado ammọ emaedọñ ideen ebịne anye ke Lakis enyʌñ ekewot anye do. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Emaeben anye enyọñ edi ke enañmbakara enyʌñ edibuuk anye ke Yeruselem ye mme eteete amọ, ke Abio Defid.<verse eid="2KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Ndin afịd mbon Yuda emaeben Asaria, a-akedooho isua duob mme itiokeed, enyʌñ enịm anye adidem ke itie ete amọ Amasaiya. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Anye akedo andikimaana mbọp Elad amaanyʌñ ayaak anye anọ Yuda ke adidem Amasaiya amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerobuam II Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme ition ke ukara Amasaiya ayịn Yoas adidem Yuda, Yerobuam ayịn Yehoas adidem Isrel amaado adidem ke Sameria, ndin anye amaakara isua aba mme keed. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌññọ iwọññọ ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ ndomokeed Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, ake anye akenamma Isrel enam. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Anye akedo awo a-akeneeñeke mme adaña Isrel tọọñọ ke Lebo Hamad tutu akesịm Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ, akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañña ato isʌñutom amọ Yọna ayịn Amitai, prọfed aketooho Kad Hefa.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakịt naña afịd awo ke Isrel, me afʌn me amanaisọñ, ekekịt ukuud; ibaaha awo se ikinwam ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Ndin sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> imiikibooho ke imọ iyaisọọk anyịñ Isrel ke idak hefịn, anye amaanyaaña ammọ ato ubọk Yerobuam ayịn Yehoas. <verse eid="2KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Yerobuam, afịd se anye akenam, ye ukeme amọ ke ekọñ, ye naña anye akemaana abọ Damaskọs ye Hamad, a-akenieghe Yuda, ado nte awo iwette isịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel?<verse eid="2KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Yerobuam amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ, mme ndidem Isrel. Ndin Sakaraiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Asaria Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme itiaba ke ukara Yerobuam adidem Isrel, Asaria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anye esʌk ekoot Usaiya; se ñko ke 2 Nd 15:6, 7, 8, 17, 23 ye 27.</char></note> ayịn Amasaiya adidem Yuda aketọọñọ adikara. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Anye akedo isua duob mme itiokeed idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua aba mme duob mme iba. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Yekolia; eka amọ aketo Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Amasaiya akenam. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Ado, awo ikiwuudo mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie; mbon awo ekesʌk ekaka iso enam mme uwa enyʌñ efọp insensi ke ndo.<verse eid="2KI 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaafiime adidem ye akpamfia tutu usen anye akekpaaha, ndin anye akedʌñ ke isio-isio ufọk. Yọtam ayịn adidem akese ñkpọ abaña ufọkadidem anyʌñ akara mbon abio.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ini ukara Asaria, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke mme ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Asaria amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ekpere ammọ ke Abio Defid. Ndin Yọtam ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sakaraiya Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme itiaita ke ukara Asaria adidem Yuda, Sakaraiya ayịn Yerobuam amaado adidem Isrel ke Sameria, ndin anye amaakara afiọñ itiokeed. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña mbon se ikibem anye iso ikaara ekenam. Anye ikiwọññọke ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, ake anye akenamma Isrel anam.<verse eid="2KI 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Salum ayịn Yabes amaadioomo abaña Sakaraiya. Anye amaanwana ye anye ke iso mbon awo, awot anye anyʌñ adat itie amọ nte adidem. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Sakaraiya ado se ewet ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> eketañña ebaña Yehu amaasu: “Mbon ubon mfo eyaetie ke ebekpo Isrel tutu ayọhọ emana inaañ.”<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salum Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Salum ayịn Yabes amaado adidem ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme usʌkkeed ke ukara Usaiya adidem Yuda, ndin anye amaakara ke Sameria afiọñ keed. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Ndin Menahem ayịn Kaadi amaato Tiasa akaa Sameria. Anye amaanwana ye Salum ayịn Yabes ke Sameria, amaawot anye amaanyʌñ adat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Salum, ye udʌkadu a-anye akedatta usʌñ, ewet ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel.<verse eid="2KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Ke ini ado Menahem, tọọñọ ke Tiasa, amaanwana Tifsa ye afịd awo ke abio ye mbọhọ, sia ammọ emaesịn edibeere inuaatob ammọ. Anye amaasuan Tifsa anyʌñ akịm idịb afịd mme ibaan idịb asai.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Menahem Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme inaañ ke ukara Asaria adidem Yuda, Menahem ayịn Kaadi amaado adidem Isrel, ndin anye amaakara ke Sameria isua duob. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke afịd ini ukara amọ anye ikiwọññọke ikpọñ ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, ake anye akenamma nọ Isrel enam.<verse eid="2KI 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Ndin Pul adidem Asiria amaadʌk isọñ ado, ndin Menahem amaanọ anye talen silfa tọsịn keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 38 me metrịk tọọn 34</char></note> ke adibere ye anye ñnyʌñ nsọọñọ ukara amọ ke abioubọọñ ado. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahem amaabọ akʌk ami ato Isrel. Afịd imọ awo ekena etịp sekel aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 575</char></note> se ediinọ adidem Asiria. Ndin adidem Asiria amaatịmme edem inyʌññọ iba aba ke isọñ.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Menahem, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo ikiwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahem amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ. Ndin Pekahia ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pekahia Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Ke ayọhọ isua aba mme duob ke ukara Asaria adidem Yuda, Pekahia ayịn Menahem amaado adidem Isrel ke Sameria, ndin anye amaakara isua iba. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Pekahia amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye ikiwọññọke ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, ake anye akenamma Isrel anam. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Keed ke atu mme ekamba adaaha amọ, Peka ayịn Remalia, amaadʌk edioomo abaña anye. Anye amaadat ideen Kilied aba mme duob adian idem, amaanyʌñ awot Pekahia, ye Aakob ye Arie, ke akpọsọñ itie ke ufọkadidem ubọọñ ke Sameria. Ndin Peka amaawot Pekahia anyʌñ adat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Pekahia, ye afịd se anye akenam, ewet ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peka Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Ke ayọhọ isua ukara Asaria aba mme duob mme iba nte adidem Yuda, Peka ayịn Remalia amaado adidem Isrel ke Sameria, ndin anye amaakara isua edịb. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye ikiwọññọke ikpọñ mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, a-anye akenamma Isrel anam.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Ke ini Peka adidem Isrel, Tiklad-Pilesa adidem Asiria amaadi anyʌñ adat Iyon, Ebeel Bed Maaka, Yanowa, Kedes ye Hasọ. Anye amaadat Kilied ye Kalili, ye afịd isọñ Naftali, anyʌñ akoono mbon awo akaa Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Ndin Hosie ayịn Ela amaadioomo abaña Peka ayịn Remalia. Anye amaanwana amaanyʌñ awot anye, ndin anye amaadat itie amọ nte adidem ke ayọhọ isua edịb ke ukara Yọtam ayịn Usaiya.<verse eid="2KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe ke ukara Peka, ndin afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel?<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yọtam Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Ke ayọhọ isua iba ke ukara Peka ayịn Remalia adidem Isrel, Yọtam ayịn Usaiya adidem Yuda amaatọọñọ ukara. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Anye akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme itiokeed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Yerusa ayịn awonwaan Sadọk. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Usaiya akenam. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Ado, awo ikiwuudo mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie; mbon awo ekesʌk ekaka iso enam mme uwa enyʌñ efọp insensi ke ndo. Yọtam amaamaana abọp Inuaatob Anyọñ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Yọtam ye se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette isịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />(Ke ini ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatọọñọ adidọñ Resịn adidem Aram ye Peka ayịn Remalia ekaa anwan ye Yuda.) <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Yọtam amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ye ammọ ke Abio Defid, abio ete amọ. Ndin Ahas ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ahas Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaba ke ukara Peka ayịn Remalia, Ahas ayịn Yọtam adidem Yuda amaatọọñọ adikara. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahas akedo isua edịb idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme itiokeed. Anye ikitieghe nte Defid ete amọ, sia anye ikinamma se inen ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />Anye amaakeene mme usʌñ ndidem Isrel, amaanyʌñ awa ayịn amọ ke ikañ, akeene anam mbubiam ido mme idịd ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebịnne asio anọ mbon Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Anye amaanam mme uwa anyʌñ afọp insensi ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, ke mme anyọñ abod ye ke idak afịd eto a-atarake.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Ndin Resịn adidem Aram ye Peka ayịn Remalia adidem Isrel emaedọọk eka adikinwana ye Yeruselem enyʌñ ekanna Ahas ekʌk, ado ammọ ikikanna anye ubọk. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Ke ini ado, Resịn adidem Aram amaamaana abọ Elad anọ Aram ke edikibịn mbon Yuda nsioño. Mbon Edọm emaedʌk Elad ndin edʌñọ do tutu usen mfịn ami.<verse eid="2KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Ahas amaadọñ isʌñutom ekedọkkọ Tiklad-Pilesa adidem Asiria, “Ami ndo afʌnadeen mfo ye awo mfo. Dọọk di nyʌñ di ñnyaaña miin sio ke ubọk adidem Aram ye adidem Isrel, enwanake ye ami.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Ndin Ahas amaakoono silfa ye kold e-ekebaaha ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke itie ubonoñkpọ ufọkadidem ubọọñ anyʌñ anọ nte enọ esọk adidem Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Adidem Asiria amaanyịmme ke anye adikinwana ye Damaskọs ñnyʌñ ndat anye. Anye amaanọ mbon ekedʌñọke do eka Kii anyʌñ awot Resịn.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Ndin Adidem Ahas amaakaa Damaskọs akesoobo Tiklad-Pilesa adidem Asiria. Anye amaakekịt akpokoro uwa ke Damaskọs ndin adọñ ekenọ aku Yuria mbid akpokoro uwa ado, ye usʌñ naña ediibọp anye ukem-ukem. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Ndin aku Yuria amaabọp akpokoro uwa akeene afịd ubonoñkpọ Adidem Ahas akenọọhọ ato Damaskọs anyʌñ akweeñe mbemiso Adidem Ahas anyọñ adi. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Ke Adidem amaaketo Damaskọs adi ndin adikịt akpokoro uwa, anye amaasịkke akpere anyʌñ anọ mme enọ ke esịd. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Anye amaanọ mme ufọfọb uwa ye uwa abakpa, amaaduọk ukọd uwa amọ, anyʌñ atiamma iyiib enọ ewuana ke ndibene akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Amaado akpokoro uwa akpoho a-akedaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaaben asio ke iso tembịd, ato ke ufọọd ufa akpokoro uwa ye tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anyʌñ adot anye ke ñkañ adoro ufa akpokoro uwa.<verse eid="2KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Adidem Ahas amaanọ aku Yuria uyio: “Ke ekamba ufa akpokoro uwa ado, nam ufọfọb uwa ubakusen ye uwa abakpa ndubiayio, ufọfọb uwa adidem ye uwa abakpa amọ, ye ufọfọb uwa afịd awo ke isọñ, ye uwa abakpa ammọ ye uwa ukọd ammọ. Tiamma iyiib afịd ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa ke akpokoro uwa ami. Ado ami ndiidat akpokoro uwa akpoho ñyem ndadusʌñ.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Ndin aku Yuria amaanam kpa naña Adidem Ahas akenọọ uyio.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Adidem Ahas amaakpok mme mben panel anyʌñ adooño mme besịn ke uwewere ñkpọndaha asio. Anye amaasio Akpainyañ akpọñ mme enañ akpoho e-ekemʌmmọ anye ekama anyʌñ adot anye ke anyọñ itiad. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Anye amaaben ufʌkayio Sabad e-ekebọppọ ke tembịd asio anyʌñ aben anyenusʌñ ubọọñ ke esa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asio, ke ukpono uyio adidem Asiria.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Ahas, ye se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette isịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ahas amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ke Abio Defid. Ndin Hesikaiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Hosie Akpatre Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme iba ke ukara Ahas adidem Yuda, Hosie ayịn Ela amaado adidem Isrel ke Sameria, ndin anye amaakara isua usʌkkeed. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado ikidooho naña ndidem Isrel ekebaaha mbemiso anye.<verse eid="2KI 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Salmanesa adidem Asiria amaadinwana ye Hosie, a-akedooho awo Salmanesa anyʌñ akekpe isob anọ anye. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Ado adidem Asiria amaayaara adiọọñọ ke Hosie akedo awo abiaña: sia anye amaadọñ mme isʌñutom esọk So adidem Iyib, ndin anye ikisikpeeghe isob aba inọ adidem Asiria naña anye akesinam isua ke isua. Ke ntak ado Salmanesa amaamʌm anye anyʌñ asịn anye ke ñkpakọb <verse eid="2KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Adidem Asiria amaadʌk afịd isọñ, adọọk akaa Sameria anyʌñ akanna anye akʌk ke isua ita. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Ke ayọhọ isua usʌkkeed ke ukara Hosie, adidem Asiria amaadat Sameria anyʌñ akoono mbon Isrel akebon ke Asiria. Anye amaabon ammọ ke Hala, ke Kosan ke Inyañ Habọ ye ke mme abio Madai.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esioño Isrel ke Idʌñ ke Ntak Idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Afịd ami aketịppe sia mbon Isrel emaenam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ, a-akesioho ammọ ke Iyib ato adudu Fero adidem Iyib. Ammọ emaekpono mme abasi mfen <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />enyʌñ ekeene mme eduuwem mme idịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebịneke asioño anọ ammọ, ye mme eduuwem ake mme ndidem Isrel ekeditọọñọke. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Mbon Isrel emaedịbe enañña mme ñkpọ i-imiikinenne ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ. Tọọñọ ke anyọñukpeme tutu awuọ akpọsọñ abio, ammọ emaebọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke afịd mme abio ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Ammọ emaewui mme asaña-asaña itiad ye mme abai Asera ke afịd abod ye ke mme idak eto e-enieghe ntara akọk. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />Ke afịd ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ammọ emaefọp insensi, naña mme idịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebịneke asioño anọ ammọ ekenam. Ammọ emaenam mme abʌd-abʌd ñkpọ se ikidemme ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Ammọ emaekpono mme ubobodñkpọ, akpesʌkado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Ndufo ikiinam ami.” <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadʌt Isrel ye Yuda utọñ ato ke mme prọfed ye mme akịdñkukịd amọ: “Iwọññọ ikpọñ mme abʌd-abʌd usʌñ ndufo. Inịm mme item ye mme ewʌhọ mmi, akeene afịd Mbed a-ami ñkenọọhọ mme eteete ndufo edinịm akọrọ ye mbon a-ami ñkinọọhọ ndufo ato ke mme isʌñutom mmi mme prọfed.”<verse eid="2KI 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Ado ammọ ikikpañña utọñ enyʌñ esọñ aboditọñ nte mme eteete ammọ, ake imiikinịmme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Ammọ emaesịn mme ewʌhọ ye edioomo amọ a-anye akenamma ye mme eteete ammọ ye mme ikọ ntiense a-anye akebooho ammọ enịm. Ammọ emaekeene ikpu-ikpu ubobodñkpọ e-ekenamma ammọ ñko ibaaha aba ufọn. Ammọ emaedubọiyọ mme idịd mfen e-edaaha ekanna ammọ, akpesʌkado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawuuk ammọ, “Ikiinam naña ammọ enam.”<verse eid="2KI 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Ammọ emaekpọñ afịd item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ enyʌñ enam ubobodñkpọ iba e-enamma ke mbid ñyịn enañ enọ idem ammọ, ye abai Asera keed. Ammọ emaetuak iwuod enọ afịd mme udịm anyọñ, enyʌñ ekpono Baal. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Ammọ emaewa nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ammọ ke ikañ. Ammọ emaebre idiọñ ye mfa enyʌñ enyam idem ammọ edinam abʌd-abʌd ido ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, edemme iyadesịd amọ.<verse eid="2KI 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanekke ayat esịd ye Isrel anyʌñ asio ammọ ke iso amọ. Esiin Yuda kpọd akesʌhọ, <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />akpesʌkado Yuda ñko ikinịmme mme item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ. Ammọ emaekeene mme eduuwem Isrel akesioho adi. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịn afịd mbon Isrel; anye amaafʌnnọ ammọ anyʌñ ayaak ammọ anọ mbon mbịme, tutu anye asio ammọ ke iso amọ.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Idaha anye akewaiya Isrel asio ke ufọk Defid, emaenam Yerobuam ayịn Nebad adidem ammọ. Yerobuam amaatap Isrel akpọñ adikeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ anam anye anam ekamba idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Mbon Isrel emaekaa iso ke afịd mme ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam inyʌññọ iwọññọ ikpọñ ammọ <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />tutu <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asio ammọ ke iso amọ, naña anye akekpan ammọ ke inua nditọufọk amọ mme prọfed. Ndin emaetañ mbon Isrel esio ke isọñ ammọ ekaa idịd Asiria, ndin ammọ mmọdo esʌk eba do.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emaana Edọñ Mbon Awo ke Sameria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Adidem Asiria amaakoono mme awo ato Babilọn, Kutaa, Affa, Hamad ye Sefafaim anyʌñ adọñ ammọ ke mme abio Sameria nọ edat itie mbon Isrel. Ammọ emaeyọhọ Sameria enyʌñ edʌñọ ke mme abio amọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Kpa ini ammọ ekedʌñọke do, ammọ ikikponoke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ndin anye amaadọñ mme ekpe ke atu ammọ anyʌñ awot usʌk ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Emaedọkkọ adidem Asiria: “Mbon awo ake afo akenọọhọ edidʌñọ ke mme abio Sameria idiọọñọke se abasi idịd ado ayem. Anye amaadọñ mme ekpe ke atu ammọ, a-awotto ammọ asio, sia mbon awo idiọọñọke se anye ayem.”<verse eid="2KI 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Ndin adidem Asiria amaanọ uyio ami: “Yak keed ke atu mme aku andufo ekemʌmmọ eto Sameria atịmme anyọñ akedʌñ do anyʌñ akpeep mbon awo se abasi isọñ ado ayem.” <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Ndin keed ke atu mme aku e-ekebịnne esio ke Sameria amaadidʌñ ke Beteel anyʌñ akpeep ammọ naña ekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Kpayeado, idịd keedekeed emaenam mme abasi ammọ ke nsio-nsio mme abio ammọ ekedʌñọke, enyʌñ ebono ammọ ke mme ñwommo ake mbon Sameria ekenamma ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Mbon Babilọn emaenam Sukọd Benod, mbon e-etooho Kutaa emaenam Nekal, ndin mbon e-etooho Hamad emaenam Asima; <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />mbon Affịm emaenam Nibhas ye Taatak, ndin mbon Sefafaim emaefọp nditọ ammọ ke ikañ nte uwa enọ Adramelek ye Anamelek, mme abasi Sefafaim. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Ammọ emaekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado ammọ emaenyʌñ emek mme nsio-nsio mbon ammọ yak edat ammọ usʌñ nte mme aku ke mme ñwommo ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Ammọ emaekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado ammọ emaenyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ mme abasi ammọ ekeene eduuwem mme idịd ammọ eketooho edi.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Tutu asịm usen mfịn ammọ ekọbọ ke akaan eduuwem ammọ. Ammọ ikponoke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌññọ inịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme ubonoñkpọ, mme mbed ye mme item ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ mme ubon Yekọb, a-anye akekoodo Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakenam edioomo ye mbon Isrel, anye amaanọ ammọ uyio: “Ikiikpono mme abasi ndomokeed mfen, ikiinyʌñ ituak iwuod inọọ ammọ, me inam ñkpọ inọọ ammọ me iwa uwa inọọ ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akenyanna akpọsọñ ubọk amọ isio ndufo ke Iyib, ado anye a-anaaha ndufo ekpono. Anye ke ndufo ediituak iwuod inọ, anye ñko ke ndufo ediiwa mme uwa inọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Ana ndufo ekpeme afịd ini adinịm mme ewʌhọ ye ubonoñkpọ, mme mbed ye mme item ake anye akewette inọọ ndufo. Ikiikpono mme abasi mfen. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Ikiifre edioomo ake ami ñkenamma ye ndufo, ñko ikiinyʌñ ikpono mme abasi mfen. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Utu ke ado, ikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo; ado anye adinyaaña ndufo isio ke ubọk afịd mme asua ndufo.”<verse eid="2KI 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Ado ammọ ikikpañña utọñ, ado ekaa iso ke mme ñkaan eduuwem ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Akpesʌkado ammọ ekesʌk ekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ammọ ekesʌk enanam ñkpọ enọ mme ubobodñkpọ ammọ. Tutu nte usen mfịn nditọ ye nditọnditọ ammọ esʌk ekaiso enam naña mme eteete ammọ ekenam.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Hesikaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua ita ke ukara Hosie ayịn Ela adidem Isrel, Hesikaiya ayịn Ahas adidem Yuda amaatọọñọ adikara. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Anye akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme usʌkkeed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Abiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Abi asʌk ado Abiya</char></note> ayịn awonwaan Sakaraiya. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Defid akenam. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Anye amaasịññe mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, aboom mme adaaha itiad anyʌñ akpok mme abai Asera aduọọñọ. Anye amaaboom udʌkikọd brọns ake Moses akenamma, sia tutu ini ado mbon Isrel ekesʌk esifọp insensi enọ anye. (Ekekoot anye Nehustan.)<verse eid="2KI 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hesikaiya amaabuọt idem ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. Ikibaaha awo se ikitie nte anye ke atu afịd mme ndidem Yuda, me mbemiso anye akara me ke anye amaakekara ima. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Anye amaayịre <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌññọ itre adikeene anye; anye amaanịm mme item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabere ye anye; anye amaanie edikan ke se akpedodo anye akenamma. Anye amaasọñ iwuod ye adidem Asiria inyʌññọ inam ñkpọ inọ anye. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Tọọñọ ke anyọñ itieukpeme tutu awuọ akpọsọñ abio, anye amaakan mbon Filistia, tutu awuọ Kasa ye ikpeghe amọ.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara Hesikaiya, a-akedooho isua itiaba ke ukara Hosie ayịn Ela adidem Isrel, Salmanesa adidem Asiria amaasaña adʌk Sameria anyʌñ akanna anye akʌk. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Ke isua ita amaakeboiyo mbon Asiria emaedat anye. Ndin emaedat Sameria ke ayọhọ isua itiokeed ke ukara Hesikaiya, a-akedooho ayọhọ isua usʌkkeed ke ukara Hosie adidem Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Adidem Asiria amaabịne mbon Isrel akaa Asiria anyʌñ adọñ ammọ ke Hala, ke Kosan ke Inyañ Habọ ye ke mme abio mbon Miid. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Ami aketịppe sia ammọ ikikoppo uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ, ado emaebiat edioomo amọ, afịd se Moses afʌnadeen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ. Ammọ ikikpañña utọñ inọ inyʌññọ inam mme item ado.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme inaañ ke ukara Adidem Hesikaiya, Senakerib adidem Asiria amaakaa ekọñ ye afịd mme ñkpọsọñ abio Yuda amaanyʌñ akoono ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Ndin Hesikaiya adidem Yuda amaadọñ utom anọ adidem Asiria ke Lakis: “Ami mmedue. Tịmme ñkpọñ miin, ndin ñyaakpe se afo akpeyem anto miin.” Adidem Asiria amaafiaaña Hesikaiya adidem Yuda ubọk abọ talen silfa ikie ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 11 me metrịk tọọn 10</char></note> ye talen kold edịb mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho tọọn 1me metrịk tọọn 1</char></note>. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Ndin Hesikaiya amaanọ anye afịd silfa se ekekịt ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke mme itie unịmñkpọ ufọk adidem ubọọñ.<verse eid="2KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Ke ini ado Hesikaiya adidem Yuda amaayaaña mme kold a-anye akedatta afʌk mme usʌñ ufọk ye mme abọbọọk anyenusʌñ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anyʌñ ayaak anọ adidem Asiria.<verse eid="2KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Senakerib Adịkke Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Adidem Asiria amaadọñ ekamba adaiso ekọñ amọ, etubom ekọñ ye adaiwuod anwaekọñ ye uwak udịmekọñ, eto Lakis ebịne Adidem Hesikaiya ke Yeruselem. Ammọ emaedọọk edi Yeruselem enyʌñ etre ke itie mmọọñ ake udiọhọ mmọọñ anyọñ, ke usʌñ a-akaaha Inwañ Ayedafọñ. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Ammọ emaedọñ ekoot adidem; ndin Eliakịm ayịn Hilkia aseñkpọ mbaña ufọkadidem, Sebna awedñwed, ye Yoa ayịn Asaf awedmbʌk ñkpọntịppe abio emaewuọñọ ekesoobo ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Ekamba adaiso ekọñ amaabo ammọ, “Idọkkọ Hesikaiya:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2KI 18:19">“ ‘Ntom ke ekamba adidem, kpa adidem Asiria, abo: Uko mfo ami asọọñọ ada ke nsoo? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Afo abo ke iminie item inyʌñ inie adudu inọ ekọñ, ado afo atañ uyaha ikọ. Anie awo ke afo adot anyen, yak afo asọñ iwuod ye ami? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Se, ami mmediọọñọ ke afo adot anyen ke Iyib, nsakka ubaak ñnyanyaha ado, a-akịmme ubọk awo keed akeedodo a-abereke ke anye. Kpa ntoro ke Fero adidem Iyib aba ye afịd mbon e-edotto anyen ke anye. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Ado adieke afo ambooho miin, “Ñnyịn idot anyen ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn,” idooho anye ke Hesikaiya akesịññe mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ye mme akpokoro uwa, ate Yuda ye Yeruselem, “Ana ndufo ekpono ke akpokoro uwa ami ke Yeruselem”?<verse eid="2KI 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />“ ‘Di ndin, dʌk edioomo unyịmme ye eteufọk mmi, adidem Asiria: ami ñyaunọ fiin enañmbakara tọsịn iba (2,000), adieke afo akanna anie mme andiwad ammọ! <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Afo akan die akaa ikọ ye andisịb ñkan ke atu mme adaaha eteufọk mmi, akpesʌkado afo adotto anyen ke mme sariọd ye mme awad enañmbakara Iyib? <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Ke aboiyoke ado, me ami mmedi adinwana ñnyʌñ nsobo itie ami ke mmeñkoppo ikọ nto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>? <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke idem amọ akembo miin yak ndinwana ekọñ ye idịd ami ñnyʌñ nsobo anye.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Ndin Eliakịm ayịn Hilkia, ye Sebna ye Yoa emaedọkkọ adaiso ekọñ ete, “Mbọk tañ ikọ nọ nditọufọk mfo ke usem Aram, sia ñnyịn imikop usem ado. Kuutañ ke usem Hibru ñnyịn se afịd awo e-ebonoke ke ndibene ekop.”<verse eid="2KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Ado adaiso ekọñ amaabọọrọ, “Ado nte eteufọk mmi akendọñ yak ndudọkkọ fiin ye eteufọk mfo kpọd mme ñkpọ ami, ke ntañ nnọọ mbon e-ebonoke ko ke ndibene, a-adooho, nte ndufo, eyaedia uduañ ammọ enyʌñ enwọñ ikịm ammọ?”<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Ndin adaiso ekọñ amaadakka ada anyʌñ adịppe uyio atañ ke usem Hibru, “Ikop ikọ ekamba adidem, kpa adidem Asiria! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Ntom ke adidem abo: Ikiiyak Hesikaiya ibiaña ndufo. Anye idiikanna ifak ndufo isio ke ubọk mmi. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Ikiiyak Hesikaiya ikpak ndufo yak ebuọt idem ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaabo, ‘Ke akpanikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaifak ñnyịn; abio ami idiiduọhọ idʌk ubọk adidem Asiria.’<verse eid="2KI 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />“Ikiikpañ utọñ inọọ Hesikaiya. Se adidem Asiria atañ ado ami: Inam emem ye ami inyʌñ idi imbịne miin. Ndin ndufo keedekeed eyaedia mfịd eto fain ndufo ye eto fik ndufo enyʌñ enwọñ mmọọñ eto ube mmọọñ ndufo, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />tutu ami ndi ndiben ndufo ñkaa isọñ a-abaaha nte ake ndufo, isọñ abakpa ye ufa ukọd, isọñ uyo ye mme inwañ fain, isọñ mme eto ọlif ye adanakwọọk. Imek uwem ikiinyʌñ imek ñkpa!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 18:32">“Ikiikpañ utọñ inọọ Hesikaiya, sia anye idat ndufo atịn usʌñ anye amaabo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaifak ñnyịn.’ <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Kpaanam abasi idịd ndomokeed afak isọñ amọ asio ke ubọk adidem Asiria? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Mmọ mme abasi Hamad ye Apad? Mmọ mme abasi Sefafaim, Hena ye Iffa? Ammọ efak Sameria esio ke ubọk mmi? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Anie ke atu afịd mme abasi mme idịd akan adinyaaña isọñ amọ isio ke ubọk mmi? Ke die ndin ke Abọọñ adiifak Yeruselem isio ke ubọk mmi?”<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Ado mbon awo emaeba ke ndobuyio inyʌññọ itañ ikọ ndomokeed ke ibọọrọ, sia adidem amaanọ ewʌhọ, “Ikiibọọrọ anye.”<verse eid="2KI 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Akem Eliakịm ayịn Hilkia aseñkpọ ke ufọkadidem, Sebna awedñwed, ye Yoa ayịn Asaf akamañwed ñkpọntịppe ke abio emaebịne Hesikaiya, ye ñwaiya afọñ ammọ, enyʌñ ekedọkkọ anye se adaiso ekọñ akebo.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Eyaara Adinyaaña Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Ke ini Hesikaiya akekoppo ikọ ami, anye amaawai afọñ amọ anyʌñ asịne afọñikpo akaa akedʌk tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Anye amaadọñ Eliakịm aseñkpọ ke ufọkadidem, Sebna awedñwed ye mme adaiso ke atu mme aku, afịd ammọ esiine afọñikpo, eka ebịne prọfed Aisaiya ayịn Emọs. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Ammọ emaedọkkọ anye, “Kop se Hesikaiya atañ mi: Mfịn ami ado usen mfʌhọ ye ntʌnọ ye asuenne, kpa naña mme nsekayịn eyem edimana ke ini uman ado inweek ibaaha se eman ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Akeme adido ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ayaakop afịd ikọ ake adaiso ekọñ, ake eteufọk amọ, adidem Asiria, adọññọ yak adimiom aduuwem Abasi, ndin anye ayaaduat anye akeene ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo akop. Ke ntoro bọñ akam nọ nsʌhọ se isʌk isʌhọ.”<verse eid="2KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Idaha mme adaaha adidem Hesikaiya ekedisooboke ye Aisaiya, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />Aisaiya amaabo ammọ, “Idọkkọ eteufọk ndufo, ‘Kop se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ mi: Kuukop ndịk ubaña se afo akop, mme ikọ ake mme nditọufọk adidem Asiria ebenne emmiom miin. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Kpañ utọñ! Ayaaba etob keed a-adooho anye amaakop, anye ayem aditịmme ñnyọñ idịd amọ, do ke ami ndiinam nọ ewot anye ke akañkañ.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Ke ini adaiso ekọñ akekop ke adidem Asiria amaakpọñ Lakis, anye amaatịmme edem akekịt ke adidem anwana ye Libna.<verse eid="2KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Ndin Senakerib amaabọ etob ke Taihaka, adidem Kuus, asʌk asaña adi adinwana ekọñ ye anye. Ndin anye amaamaana adọñ mme isʌñutom anọ Hesikaiya ye ikọ ami: <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Dọkkọ Hesikaiya adidem Yuda: Kuuyak abasi ake afo abuọttọ idem ubiaña fiin ke ini anye abooho, ‘Awo idiiyaaha Yeruselem isịn ke ubọk adidem Asiria.’ <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Ke akpanikọ afo amekop se mme ndidem Asiria enam afịd mme idịd, ke adisobo ammọ afịd-afịd. Ndin eyaunyaaña fiin? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Nte mme abasi mme idịd ado ake mbon se ikimbem miin iso ikara Asiria ekesoboke emaenyaaña ammọ, mme abasi Kosan, Haran, Resef ye mbon Idịn ekebaaha ke Tel Asaa? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Mmọ adidem Hamad me adidem Apad? Mmọ ndidem abio Laiye, Sefafaim, Hena ye Iffa?”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akam Hesikaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Hesikaiya amaabọ ñwedetob ato mme isʌñutom anyʌñ akoot. Ndin anye amaakaa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ adette anye anịm ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Ndin Hesikaiya amaabọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, a-atieghe ke ufọọd serubim, afo ikpọọñ ado Abasi ke afịd mme abioubọọñ ke ekondo ke isọñ. Afo anam anyọñ ye isọñ. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Kpañ utọñ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; nyʌñ kop; tat anyen mfo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nyʌñ kịt; kop mme ikọ se Senakerib adọñ nọ esịn anyịñ Aduuwem Abasi ke ndek.<verse eid="2KI 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />“Abọọñ, ado akpanikọ ke ndidem Asiria e-esobo mme idịd emi ye mme isọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Ammọ etoomo mme abasi ammọ edọñ ke ikañ enyʌñ esobo ammọ, sia ammọ ikidooho mme abasi ado edo eto ye itiad, se ubọk awo anam. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Idahami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, fak ñnyịn sio ke ubọk amọ, nọ afịd mme idịd ediọọñọ ke afo ikpọọñ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado Abasi.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aisaiya Atañ Prọfesi abaña Iduọ Senakerib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Ndin Aisaiya ayịn Emọs amaanọ etob esọk Hesikaiya: Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo: Ami mmekop akam mfo ke abaña Senakerib adidem Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Ami ado ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña anye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Mboppo Ayịn Awonwaan Saiyọn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">use fiin ke ndek anyʌñ usak fiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Ayịn Awonwaan Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">anyeghe iwuod amọ naña afo afegheke.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Anie ke afo ase ke mbio anyʌñ amiom?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Afo adịppe uyio mfo abaña anie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">anyʌñ adịppe anyen mfo ke ntañidem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Abaña Adisana Abasi Isrel!<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />Afo amekama isʌñutom mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">amiom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Afo amenyʌñ abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">“Ye uwak sariọd mmi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">ami mmedọọk nsịm mme atịñe ikpọabod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ataa ñkoñ-ñkoñ anyọñ abod Lebanọn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Ami mmekpok mme ñnyọọññkan eto sida amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">mme mfọọn edimek eto yunipa amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Ami mmesịm ataa akpatre esịd amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">mme mfọọnñkan akai amọ.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Ami mmetịppe mme ube mmọọñ ke mme asen idịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">ñnyʌñ ñnwọñ mmọọñ nto do.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Ye ekaikpad mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">ami mmenam afịd mme idịm ke Iyib esat.”<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />Ado nte afo ukoppo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">Akpeene ami ñkebiere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Ke mme usen edem ami mmaanam uduak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">idahami ami mmenam anye awuọ asu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">ke afo amenam mme ñkpọsọñ abio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">ekappa edo mme eboho itiad.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Mbon ammọ, u-udịd amaakweeñe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">idem anyʌñ abọkkọ e-ekop abuud.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Ammọ eba nte eto ke inwañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">nte ndisi awawa emịne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">nte mbid a-atịppeke ke akọm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">asaat mbemiso anye akọt.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />Ado ami mmediọọñọ nte afo aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ye ini se afo adi ye ini anyʌññọ anyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ye naña afo atọhọ ye ami.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Sia afo atọhọke ye ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">ñko sia usọñanyen mfo awuọ utọñ mmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">ami ñyaasịn ekọb mmi ke iwuo mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">ye ukwak mmi ke inua mfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">ndin ami ñyaanam afo atịmme anyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">kpa ke usʌñ afo aketooho adi.<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Hesikaiya, ami adiido idiọọñọ unọ fiin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Isua ami afo uduudia se itịppe ke idem amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">ndin ayọhọ isua iba se itịppe ito akpa ado.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:29">Ado ke ayọhọ isua ita tọ nyʌñ dọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">tọ mme inwañ fain nyʌñ dia mme mfịd ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Inikeed mfen nsʌhọ abioubọọñ Yuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">ayaanie adʌñ ke idak isọñ anyʌñ anwịm mfịd ke anyọñ.<verse eid="2KI 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Sia nsʌhọ ayaato ke Yeruselem awuọ adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:31">mbon e-ebọkkọke eyaenyʌñ eto Abod Saiyọn.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2KI 19:31">“Akpọsọñ udọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan adiinam ami awuọ asu.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />“Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami abaña adidem Asiria:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">“ ‘Anye idiidʌkkọ abio ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">idiinyʌññọ itop idañ mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:32">Anye idiikamake atuekọñ ibịne abio ami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">idiinyʌññọ ibọp nnaaekọñ ikanna anye ikʌk.<verse eid="2KI 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Usʌñ nte anye aketo adi ke anye adisaña inyọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">anye idiidʌkkọ abio ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo.<verse eid="2KI 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />Ami ñyaakpeme abio ami ñnyʌñ ñnyaaña anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:34">ke ntak mmi ye ke ntak afʌnadeen mmi Defid.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Akonayio ado enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakaa akewot awo tọsịn ikie mme anaañ mme ition (185,000) ke nnaaekọñ Asiria. Mbon awo ekedemme ubakusen edemusen, sese afịd akedo mme akpo awo! <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Ndin Senakerib adidem Asiria amaasuan nnaaekọñ anyʌñ atịmme edem. Anye amaanyọñ Ninife anyʌñ akeba do.<verse eid="2KI 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Usen keed, anye akesʌk akpono abasi amọ Nisrọk ke tembịd, nditọ ideen amọ Adramelek ye Saresa emaewot anye ke akañkañ, ndin efeeñe ekaa isọñ Ararad. Ndin Esahadọn ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Udọñọ Hesikaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Ke ini ado Hesikaiya amaadọñọ anyʌñ akpere ñkpa. Prọfed Aisaiya ayịn Emọs amaakaa abịne anye akebo, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Tịm ufọk mfo nịm, sia afo ayaakpa; uduukoppo nsọñidem.”<verse eid="2KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Hesikaiya amaawọññọ iso ase ndibene amaanyʌñ abọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> toiyo naña ami nsisaña ke iso mfo ke akpanikọ ye ke afịd esịd ñnyʌñ nnam se inen ke iso mfo.” Ndin Hesikaiya amaatua ataa idod-idod ayịd.<verse eid="2KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Mbemiso Aisaiya akpọkpọñ ufọọd akwere adidem, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm anye: <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />“Tịmme kaa kedọkkọ Hesikaiya, andikara mbon mmi, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ete mfo Defid, atañ ado ami: Ami mmekop akam mfo mmenyʌñ ñkịt mmọọñayịd mfo; ami ñyaukọk fiin. Ke ayọhọ usen ita tọọñọ ke idahami afo ayaakaa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Ami ñyaadian isua duob mme ition ke uwem mfo. Ndin ami ñyaufak fiin ye abio ami nsio ke ubọk adidem Asiria. Ami ñyaakpeme abio ami ke ntak mmi ye ke ntak afʌnadeen mmi Defid.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Ndin Aisaiya amaabo, “Inuakka fik.” Ammọ emaenam ntoro enyʌñ edot ke ndufuud ado, ndin idem amaasọñ anye.<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Hesikaiya amaabịp Aisaiya, “Nsoo idiido idiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayañkọk miin ndin ke ñyaadọọk ñkaa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ayọhọ usen ita tọọñọ ke mfịn?”<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Aisaiya amaabọọrọ, “Ami ado idiọọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> unọọhọ fiin ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam se anye akenwọñọ: Ayem ndukpọñ akaa iso ikpad duob me ayem atịmme edem ikpad duob?”<verse eid="2KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Hesikaiya amaabo, “Ado mmem-mmem ñkpọ ndukpọñ adika iso ikpad duob, utu ke ado, yak atịmme edem ikpad duob.”<verse eid="2KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Ndin prọfed Aisaiya amaakoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam ndukpọñ atịmme edem ikpad duob naña anye aketịmmeke ke utọukod Ahas.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Isʌñutom Eto Babilọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Ke ini ado Maduk-Baladan ayịn Baladan adidem Babilọn amaanọ mme ñwedetob esọk Hesikaiya ye enọ, sia anye amaakop abaña udọñọ Hesikaiya. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hesikaiya amaabọ mme isʌñutom ado anyʌñ awọọt ammọ afịd se ikidọñọ ke ufọk ubonoñkpọ amọ, mme silfa, mme kold, mme anemufịk mfiọññọ ye mme nti adan ọlif, itie ñkpọekọñ ye afịd ñkpọ se ikidọñọ ke atu mme inie amọ. Ibaaha ñkpọ ndomokeed ke ufọk adidem me ke afịd idak ukara amọ ake Hesikaiya imiikiwọttọ ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Akem prọfed Aisaiya amaakaa abịne adidem Hesikaiya akebịp, “Nsoo ke ideen ado ekebo, ñko ammọ eketo uke edi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:14">“Eketo anyan idịd,” Hesikaiya amaabọọrọ, “Ammọ eketo Babilọn edi.”<verse eid="2KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Prọfed amaabịp, “Nsoo ke ammọ ekekịt ke ufọkadidem?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 20:15">Hesikaiya amaabo, “Ammọ emaekịt afịd ñkpọ ke ufọkadidem. Ibaaha ñkpọuto ke atu inie mmi ake ami mmeñkewọttọ ammọ.”<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Ndin Aisaiya amaabo Hesikaiya, “Kop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />Ke akpanikọ ini ayaadi ake afịd ñkpọ ke ufọkubọọñ mfo, ye afịd se mbon se ikubem fiin iso ikaara ekebono tutu awuọ usen mfịn, ediikoono inyọñ Babilọn. Ñkpọ ndomokeed idiisʌhọke, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Ndin ubaak mbon ubon mfo, abʌk ye iyiib mfo se ediiman unọ fiin, eyaeben ammọ esio, ndin ammọ eyaekedo mme itọ ke ufọk adidem Babilọn.”<verse eid="2KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Hesikaiya amaabọọrọ Aisaiya, “Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se afo atañ afọn.” Sia anye amaakere, “Nte emem ye ifuuro idiibaaha ke ayio uwem mmi?”<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Hesikaiya, afịd se anye akenam ye naña anye akenam ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ ye usʌñ ake anye akedọkkọ ke esịdisọñ asio mmọọñ asịn ke abio, ado nte awo iwette isịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Hesikaiya amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ. Ndin Manase ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Manase Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manase akedo isua duob mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua aba mme duob mme ition. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Hefsiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akeene mme abʌd-abʌd mbubiam ido ake mme idịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebịnne asio anọ mbon Isrel. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Anye amaamaana abọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ake ete amọ Hesikaiya amaakewuut; ñko anye amaabọp mme akpokoro uwa anọ Baal anyʌñ anam abai Asera, kpa naña Ehab adidem Isrel akenam. Anye amaatuak iwuod anọ afịd mme udịmanyọñ anyʌñ akpono ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Anye amaabọp mme akpokoro uwa ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabobo, “Ke Yeruselem ke ami ndiinịm Anyịñ mmi.” <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Ke naña akwere iba ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaabọp mme akpokoro uwa anọ afịd mme udịmanyọñ. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Anye amaawa ayịn amọ awodeen ke ikañ, abre idiọñ, aduuñọ ñkpọ, anyʌñ akaa abịne mbon useñkpọ ye mbiamfa. Anye amaanam uwak mbubiam ndiọiñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anam iyadesịd amọ ademme.<verse eid="2KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Anye amaaben ukakab eto Asera ake anye akenamma akewuuk ke esịd tembịd, a-adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Defid ye ayịn amọ Sọlọmọn, “Ke tembịd ami ye ke Yeruselem, ake ami mmekke nsio ke atu mme esiin Isrel, ke ndiinịm Anyịñ mmi ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Ami ndiinamma aba ukod nditọ Isrel eyooñ ekpọñ isọñ ami ñkenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ, adieke ammọ ediikpeme edinam afịd se ñkewuuk ammọ nnọ ammọ enam enyʌñ enịm afịd Mbed afʌnadeen mmi Moses akenọọhọ ammọ.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Ado mbon awo ikikpañña utọñ. Manase amaadat ammọ atịn usʌñ, anam ammọ emaenam idiọọkñkpọ a-akekanna ake mme idịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesoboke mbemiso mbon Isrel.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ato inua isʌñutom amọ mme prọfed: <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />“Manase adidem Yuda anam mme mbubiam ndiọiñkpọ. Anye anam ndiọiñkpọ awak akan mbon Amọọ e-ekebaññake mbemiso anye anyʌñ aben Yuda asịn ke idiọọkñkpọ ye mme ubobodñkpọ amọ. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel abo ado ami: Ami ñyaadat nsobo nsọk Yeruselem ye Yuda, utọ a-adooho utọñ afịd awo e-ekoppo ebaña anye eyaekpaaña nsa. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Ami ñyaanekke udʌk udomoñkpọ ekekamake ke Sameria ke Yeruselem ye ndoppo udʌk ekekamake ke ufọk Ehab. Ami ñyaakwokko Yeruselem naña awo akwokko usan, awọññọ anọ umi awọññọ asuuk ke isọñ. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Ami ñyaafre mme nsʌhọ udeeme mmi ñnyʌñ ñyaak ammọ nsịn ke ubọk mme asua. Mme asua ammọ eyaebịme enyʌñ esuan ammọ; <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />ammọ emaenam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen mmi emaenyʌñ edemme ifiobesịd mmi tọọñọ ke usen ammọ ekekpọññọ Iyib tutu usen mfịn.”<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Ñko, Manase amaaduọk uwak iyiib mbon i-imiidueghe tutu ayọhọ Yeruselem tọọñọ ke edem keed akewuọ edem uko, ke amaaboiyo idiọọkñkpọ ake anye akenamma yak Yuda anam, ndin ammọ emaenam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen se ikitịppe ke ukara Manase, ye afịd se anye akenam, dian ye idiọọkñkpọ anye akenamma, ado nte awo iwette isịn ke mme ñwed mbʌkutom ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Manase amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ enyʌñ ebuuk anye ke inwañ ufọkadidem, inwañ Usa. Ndin Amọn ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amọn Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amọn akedo isua edịb mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua iba. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Mesulemed ayịn awonwaan Harus; anye aketo Yọtba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Manase akenam. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Anye amaakeene usʌñ ete amọ afịd-afịd, akpono mme usọsọi ñkpọ ake ete amọ akekponoke, anyʌñ atuak iwuod anọ ammọ. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />Anye amaadiañña akpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete amọ, inyʌññọ isaña ke ñkobitem inọ anye.<verse eid="2KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Mme adaaha Amọn emaedʌk idiọọk adu ebaña anye enyʌñ ewot adidem ke ufọkubọọñ amọ. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Akem mbon abio emaewot afịd mbon se ikidʌk idiọọk adu ibaña Adidem Amọn, ndin ammọ emaenam Yosaiya ayịn amọ adidem ke itie amọ.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Amọn, ye se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Anye akebʌhọ ke udi ke inwañ Usa. Ndin Yosaiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ekịt Ñwed Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Yosaiya akedo isua itiaita idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme duob mme keed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Yedida ayịn awonwaan Adaiya; anye aketo Boskad. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ akeene ayọhọ-ayọhọ ke mme usʌñ ete amọ Defid, iwọññọke idʌk nnasia me ufiin.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara amọ, Adidem Yosaiya amaadọñ awedñwed, Safan ayịn Asalia, ayịn Mesulam, aka tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye amaabo: <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />“Dọọk kaa bịne Hilkia ekamba aku nyʌñ nam yak anye abeeñe afịd akʌk ebenne edi tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anịm, ake mme akpeme anyenusʌñ ebọiyọ eto mbon awo. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Nam ammọ eyaak esịn ke ubọk ideen eseeghe ñkpọ ebaña utom ke tembịd. Yak ideen emi ekpe mbon utom e-ekediọññọ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />mme akọñeto, mme abọbufọk ye mme akọọkufọk. Nam ammọ edep eto enyʌñ ediọñ itiad se ekama ediọñ tembịd. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Ado ammọ inaaha enam ibad akʌk e-enọọhọ ammọ, sia ammọ e-enam akpanikọ ke utom.”<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Hilkia ekamba aku amaabo Safan awedñwed, “Ami mmekịt Ñwed Mbed ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Ndin Safan awedñwed amaabịne adidem akedọkkọ anye: “Mme adaaha mfo e-ekpe akʌk a-akebaaha ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ eyaak esịn ke ubọk mme anam utom ye mme aseutom e-emekke ke tembịd.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Ndin Safan awedñwed amaadọkkọ adidem abo, “Hilkia aku amannọ miin ñwed.” Ndin Safan amaakoot ñwed ado ke iso adidem.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Adidem amaakekop mme ikọ e-etooho Ñwed Mbed, anye amaawai mme afọñ amọ. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Anye amaanọ aku Hilkia, Ahikam ayịn Safan, Akbọ ayịn Maikaiya, Safan awedñwed ye Asaiya andise ñkpọ mbaña adidem mme ewʌhọ ami: <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Ikaa inyʌñ ikibịp ito <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> innọ miin ye afịd awo ye afịd Yuda ibaña se ewet ke ñwed e-ekịtte mi. Ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ake ifọppọ ñnyịn akpon sia mbon e-ekibemme ñnyịn iso eba ikinịmme mme ikọ ke ñwed ami; ammọ ikinamma ikeene afịd se ewet ke esịd ado ake ibañake ñnyịn.”<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Aku Hilkia, Ahikam, Akbọ, Safan ye Asaiya emaekaa edikitañ ikọ ye prọfed Hulda, a-akedooho anwaan Salum ayịn Tikfa, ayịn Hahas, akpeme iseafọñ. Anye akedʌñ ke Yeruselem, ke Ufa Efaak.<verse eid="2KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Anye amaabo ammọ, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo: Dọkkọ awodeen a-akudọññọ fiin annọọ miin, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ami ñyaaben nsobo nsịn ke itie ami ye mbon amọ, akeene afịd ñkpọ se ewet ke ñwed ake adidem Yuda akoodo. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Sia ammọ eñkpọñ miin ndin ekefọp insensi enọ mme abasi mfen enyʌñ edemme ifiobesịd mmi ato ke afịd mme ubobodñkpọ se ubọk ammọ abot, iyadesịd mmi ayaafiop ke itie ami ndin idiinyʌññọ inịme.’ <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Idọkkọ adidem Yuda, akidọññọ ndufo edibịp eto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ abaña mme ikọ se afo akekop: <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />Sia afo amaanyịmme ke esịd mfo amaanyʌñ asuuhọ idem mfo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ini afo akekoppo se ami ñketañ mbaña itie ami ye mbon amọ, ke ammọ ediido isuuñọ enyʌñ edo nsobo, ndin sia afo amaawai mme afọñ mfo anyʌñ atua ke iso mmi, ami ñko mmukop fiin, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Ke ntoro ami ñyauben fiin nsọk mme eteete mfo, ndin eyaubuuk fiin ke emem. Anyen mfo idiikịtte afịd nsobo ake ami ndiiben ndi ke itie ami.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Ndin ammọ emaeben ibọọrọ amọ esọk adidem.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yosaiya Amaana Ademme Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Ndin adidem amaakoot afịd mme ñkpisọñ ake Yuda ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Anye amaadọọk akaa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mbon Yuda, mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem, mme aku ye mme prọfed, afịd mbon awo tọọñọ ke andisịb ñkan tutu awuọ andikpon ñkan. Anye amaakoot afịd mme ikọ Ñwed Edioomo e-ekekịtte ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ammọ ekop. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Adidem amaada ke mben abai amaana ademme edioomo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adikeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyʌñ nnịm mme ewʌhọ amọ, ye mme item ye mme mbed amọ ke afịd esịd ye ke afịd ukpọñ amọ, ado ndin amaasọọñọ mme ikọ edioomo e-ewette ke ñwed ami. Ndin afịd awo emaesọọñọ enyʌñ enyịmme edida ke edioomo ado.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Adidem amaabo Hilkia akwa aku, mme udiana aku ye mme akpemeusʌñ esioño afịd ñkpoduoho se ekenam enọ Baal ye Asera ye afịd mme udịmanyọñ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye amaafọp ammọ ke ewuọhọ ekpọñ Yeruselem ke inwañ Abedeñ Kidrọn anyʌñ akoono ntọñ akaa Beteel. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Anye amaatre mme aku e-emaaha ubobodñkpọ ake mme ndidem Yuda ekemekke nọ esifọp insensi ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke mme abio Yuda ye mbon se iba ke ñkanñkʌk Yeruselem, mbon e-ekefọppọ insensi enọ Baal, enọ utịn ye afiọñ, enọ mme udịmanyọñ. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Anye amaasio abai Asera ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akaa Abedeñ Kidrọn ke ewuọhọ ekpọñ Yeruselem anyʌñ afọp anye do. Anye amaakọk anye aforo ntọñ ndin asuan ntọñ ado ke mme udi mme ñkaña awo. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Anye amaanyʌñ awuut itieidʌñ mme akpara ideen ekebaaha ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, itieidʌñ ibaan e-ekesituakka afọñ enọ Asera.<verse eid="2KI 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Yosaiya amaaben afịd mme aku ato mme abio Yuda anyʌñ asappa mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, tọọñọ ke Keba tutu awuọ Beeseba, itie a-mme aku ekefọppọ insensi. Anye amaawuut usʌñatob ke ntondʌk Atob Yọsua, etubom abio, a-akebaaha ke ubọk ufiin inuaatob abio. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Akpesʌkado mme aku mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ikinamma ñkpọ ke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem, ammọ emaeta uyo se yiis imiisịneke ye mme emọ-emọ aku ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Anye amaasappa Tofed, a-akebaaha ke Abedeñ Ben Hinọm, mbaak awo ndomokeed adikama awa ayịn me ayịn awonwaan ke ikañ Mọlek. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Anye amaasioño ke ntondʌk tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mme enañmbakara ake mme ndidem Yuda ekediọññọ enịm enọ utịn. Ammọ ekebono ke akwere a-akpereke ubeed adaaha keed e-ekekoodo Natan-Melek. Ndin Yosaiya amaafọọmọ mme sariọd e-ekenịmme enọ utịn.<verse eid="2KI 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Anye amaawuut mme akpokoro uwa mme ndidem Yuda ke akọm a-akpereke ubeed anyọñ Ahas, ye mme akpokoro uwa Manase akebọppọ ke mme akwere iba ake tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye amaasioño ammọ ke ndo, asuan ammọ ñkeñe-ñkeñe anyʌñ atoomo ammọ adọñ ke Abedeñ Kidrọn. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Adidem amaanyʌñ asappa mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ekebaññake ke usakkautịn Yeruselem ke usuuk Abod Mbubiam, mbon se Sọlọmọn adidem Isrel akebọp anọ Astọred abʌd-abʌd abasianwaan mbon Sidọn, ake Kemos abʌd-abʌd abasi mbon Mọb, ye ake Molek abʌd-abʌd abasi mbon Amọn. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Yosaiya amaaboom mme ndisana itiad anyʌñ akpok mme abai Asera anyʌñ afʌk mme itie ado ye mme akpọ awo.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Kpa ye tembịd ke Beteel, ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, akenamma Isrel enam idiọọkñkpọ anye amaawuut kpa ye akpokoro uwa ado ye ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie anyʌñ akọk anye aforo ntọñ, anyʌñ afọp abai Asera ñko. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Akem Yosaiya amaaseet akanna, ndin anye akekịt mme udi ke anyọñ abod, anye amaanam ekoono mme akpọ ado enyʌñ efọp ke akpokoro uwa nọ esappa anye, nọ akekem ye ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ato awo Abasi a-aketañña abaña mme ñkpọ ami.<verse eid="2KI 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Adidem amaabịp, “Nsoo ido itiad udi a-ami ñkịtte ko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 23:17">Mbon abio ado emaebo, “Ado idiọọñọ awo Abasi a-aketooho Yuda adi anyʌñ atañ abaña akpokoro uwa Beteel mme ñkpọ a-afo anamma abaña anye.”<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Anye amaabo “Saana yaak, kuuyak awo ndomokeed atịmede mme akpọ amọ.” Ndin ammọ emaesaana mme akpọ amọ eyaak ye ake prọfed aketooho Sameria adi.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Kpa naña anye akenam ke Beteel, Yosaiya amaasịññe afịd mme tembịd ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ake mme ndidem Isrel ekebọppọ ke mme abio Sameria a-akedemmeke ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Yosaiya amaawoot afịd mme aku mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke mme akpokoro uwa anyʌñ afọp mme akpọ awo ke anyọñ ado. Ndin anye amaatịmme anyọñ Yeruselem.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Adidem amaanọ uyio enọ afịd awo: “Idia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, kpa naña ewet ke Ñwed Edioomo ami.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Kpaanam awo ikinamma Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo a-akebaaha ntoro, me ke ayio mme abiideikpe e-ekedatta Isrel usʌñ me ke ini mme ndidem Isrel ye mme ndidem Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Ado ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara Adidem Yosaiya, emaenam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ami enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Ke adidian do, Yosaiya amaabịne mbiaidiọñ, ye mme ekpoawo, mme abasi ufọk, mme ubobodñkpọ ye mme mbubiam ñkpọ ekekịtte ke Yuda ye Yeruselem. Anye akenam ami nọ enam afịd se ekeyem ke mbed e-ekewette ke ñwed aku Hilkia akekịtte ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Me mbemiso Yosaiya, me aboiyoke anye, utọ adidem a-akebaaha nte anye, a-akewọññọke akeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña anye akenam ke afịd esịd amọ ye afịd ukpọñ amọ ye afịd ukeme amọ, akeene afịd mbed Moses, ikibaaha.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Kpayeado, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikiwọññọke iyadesịd a-anye akenieghe abaña Yuda akeene afịd se Manase akenam adidemme ifiobesịd amọ. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Ami ñyaasio Yuda mfep ke iso mmi naña ñkesio Isrel, ndin ñyaasịn Yeruselem, abio ami ñkemekke, ye tembịd ami, ake ami ñkebooho mbaña, ‘Anyịñ mmi adiiba do.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yosaiya, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌk utom mme ndidem Yuda?<verse eid="2KI 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Idaha Yosaiya akedooho adidem, Fero Neko adidem Iyib amaadọọk akaa Inyañ Yufretis adikinwam adidem Asiria. Adidem Yosaiya amaasaña akaa adikisoobo anye ke ekọñ, ado Neko amaanwana ye anye anyʌñ awot anye ke Mekido. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Nditọufọk Yosaiya emaeben akpo amọ ke sariọd eto Mekido ekaa Yeruselem emaenyʌñ ekebuuk anye ke udi amọ. Ndin mbon isọñ abio ado emaeben Yehoahas ayịn Yosaiya eyet anye adan enyʌñ enam anye adidem ke itie ete amọ.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoahas Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Yehoahas akedo isua edịb mme ita idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem afiọñ ita. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Hamutal ayịn awonwaan Yerimaiya; anye aketo Libna. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña mme eteete amọ ekenam. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Fero Neko amaadọñ anye ñkpọnọ ke Ribla ke isọñ Hamad mbaak anye adikara ke Yeruselem, amaanyʌñ adot isob talen silfa ikie (100)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 3/4 me metrịk tọọn 3,4</char></note> ye talen kold keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note> anọ Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Fero Neko amaanam Eliakịm ayịn Yosaiya adidem ke itie ete amọ Yosaiya anyʌñ akpəho anyịñ Eliakịm akoot anye Yehoiyakịm. Ado anye amaaben Yehoahas anyọñ Iyib, ndin anye amaakekpa ke udo. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Yehoiyakịm amaakpe Fero Neko silfa ye kold a-anye akeyemme. Nọ ato do anye akan anam ntoro, anye amaadot ekọmudua anọ isọñ anyʌñ anam mbon awo etịp silfa ye kold akeene naña ekebiere enọ ammọ.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiyakịm Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Yehoiyakịm akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme keed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Sebida ayịn awonwaan Pedaiya aketooho Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Ndin anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña mme eteete amọ ekenam.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Ke ayio ukara Yehoiyakịm, Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaanwana ekọñ ye isọñ, ndin Yehoiyakịm amaakappa asuuk iwuod anọ anye ke isua ita. Akem anye amaadiwọññọ anyʌñ asọñ iwuod ye Nebukadnesa. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ mbon Babilọn, Aram, Mọb ye Amọn ebịne anye enyʌñ esobo Yuda, akeene ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ke uyio isʌñutom amọ mme prọfed. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Ke akpanikọ mme ñkpọ ami emaetịppe enọ Yuda akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ esio ammọ ke iso amọ ke ntak mme ndiọiñkpọ Manase ye afịd se anye akenam, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />ye adiduọk iyiib awo ammiidueghe isob. Sia anye amaayọhọ Yeruselem ye iyiib mbon i-imiidueghe, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikibeeñeke idem adifeen.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Amaado mme ñkpọ ntịppe ke ukara Yehoiyakịm, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette isịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Yehoiyakịm amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ. Ndin Yehoiyakịn ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Adidem Iyib ikisañake iwuọ ikpọñ idịd amọ aba, sia adidem Babilọn amaadat afịd efaak amọ, tọọñọ ke Wadi ake Iyib tutu akewuọ Inyañ Yufretis.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiyakịn Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Yehoiyakịn akedo isua duob mme itiaita idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem afiọñ ita. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Nehusta ayịn awonwaan Elnatan; anye aketo Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ akenam.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Ke ini mme etubom ekọñ Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ekedʌkkọ Yeruselem ekenyʌñ ekanna abio ado ekʌk, <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />ndin Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn ke idem amọ amaadọọk adiwuọ abio idaha mme etubom ekọñ amọ ekesʌkkọ ekanna anye ekʌk. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Yehoiyakịn adidem Yuda, eka amọ, mme mbed amọ, mme ñkpisọñ ye mme adaaha emaesuuk iwuod enọ anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:12">Ke ayọhọ isua itiaita ke ukara adidem Babilọn, anye amaadat Babilọn, asịn Yehoiyakịn ke ñkpakọb. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ, Nebukadnesa amaakoono mme nsọñudua ñkpọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke ufọk ubọọñ, anyʌñ akpok mme ñkpoduoho kold ake Sọlọmọn adidem Isrel akenamma anọ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Anye amaakoono afịd Yeruselem akaa asenidịd: afịd mme etubom ekọñ ye mme anwana anwan, ye nta mme anam utomusọ afịd ekedo tọsịn duob. Mme akpọikpọi uweene kpọd ekesʌhọ ke isọñ ado.<verse eid="2KI 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Nebukadnesa amaamʌm Yehoiyakịn anyọñ Babilọn. Anye amaanyʌñ amʌm eka adidem, mme ibaan amọ, mme adaaha amọ ye mme adaaha ke isọñ akpọñ Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Adidem Babilọn amaanọ afịd mbon ekọñ e-ekedooho awo tọsịn itiaba yak eka Babilọn, mbon e-ekoppo adudu enyʌñ edot se inwana ekọñ, ye mbon utom ye nta mme anam utomusọ tọsịn keed. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Adidem Babilọn amaanam Matania, ayịneka ete Yehoiyakịn, adidem ke itie amọ ndin akpəho anyịñ amọ akappa ado Sedekaiya.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sedekaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Sedekaiya akedo isua edịb mme keed idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme keed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Hamutal ayịn awonwaan Yerimaiya; anye aketo Libna. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña Yehoiyakịm akenam. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Ke ntak iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam afịd mme ñkpọ ami aketịppe ke Yeruselem ye Yuda, ndin ke akpatre anye amaabịne ammọ asio ke iso amọ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2KI 24:20">Iduọ Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:20">Ndin Sedekaiya amaasọñ iwuod ye adidem Babilọn.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Ndin ke ayọhọ isua usʌkkeed ke ini ukara Sedekaiya, ke ayọhọ usen duob ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob, Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaasaña ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ akaa ekọñ ye Yeruselem. Anye amaanịm nnaaekọñ ke ñkanñkʌk abio anyʌñ abọọp mme nnaaekọñ akanna anye akʌk. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Ammọ emaekanna abio ado ekʌk tutu ayọhọ isua duob mme keed ke ini ukara adidem Sedekaiya.<verse eid="2KI 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Ke ayọhọ usen usʌkkeed ke ayọhọ afiọñ inaañ, akañ amaakpon ke abio ado eti-eti tutu ndidia ikibaaha aba se mme awo edia. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Akem emaewuut ndibene abio ado, ndin afịd udịmekọñ emaefeeñe ke akonayio ewuọ ke inuaatob eto ke ufañ ndibene iba akekpereke inwañ adidem, akpesʌkado a-adooho mbon Babilọn emaekekanna abio ekʌk. Ammọ emaefeeñe ekaa ñkañ Araba, <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />ado udịmekọñ Babilọn emaebịne adidem enyʌñ ekemʌm anye ke mme unaisọñ Yeriko. Emaediañña afịd mbon ekọñ amọ ekpọñ anye enyʌñ esuana, <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />ndin emaemʌm anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 25:6">Emaeben anye esọk adidem Babilọn ke Ribla, do ke ekebiere ikpe enọ anye. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Ammọ emaewot nditọ ideen Sedekaiya ke iso amọ. Ndin emaekaap anye anyen esịññe, ebọp anye ke ñkpọnọ brọns ndin emaeben anye enyọñ Babilọn.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition, ke ayọhọ isua duob mme usʌkkeed ukara Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn, Nebusaradan adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem, adaaha adidem Babilọn, amaadi Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Anye amaasịn ikañ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ufọkubọọñ adidem ye afịd ufọk ke Yeruselem. Anye amaafọp afịd akpan ufọk. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Afịd udịmekọñ Babilọn ke idak ndadusʌñ adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem emaewuut afịd ndibene e-edaaha ekanna Yeruselem. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Nebusaradan adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem amaakoono anyọñ nte ntañnsio ñyọhọnsʌhọ mbon awo ke abio, ye mbon mfen ye mbon e-ekefeeñeke ebịne adidem Babilọn. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Ado adaiso ekọñ amaasʌhọ ubaak mme akpọikpọi uweene ke abio ado edinam utom ke mme inwañ fain ye ke mme inwañ mfen.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Mbon Babilọn emaeboom mme adaaha brọns, mme itiad idaha ye Akpainyañ brọns ekebaaha ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin ammọ emaekoono mme brọns ami enyọñ Babilọn. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekoono mme ako, mme udọk, mme ufadikañ, mme usañ ye afịd ñkpoduoho brọns e-ekamake enam utom ke tembịd. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Adaiso udịmekọñ ukpeme adidem amaakoono mme sensa ye usan usiime mmọọñ, afịd se ekedat ataa kold me ataa silfa enam.<verse eid="2KI 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Brọns aketooho mme abai iba ado, Akpainyañ ye mme uwewere ñkpọndaha ake Sọlọmọn akenamma anọ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, amaadoppo akan se ekpekekan edomo. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Unyọọñ abai keed akedo kubid duob mme itiaita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte mita 8.1</char></note>. Brọns akedoroke ke anyọñ abai keed akedo kubid ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte mita 1.4</char></note> ke unyọọñ enyʌñ ekama iyịre ye mme pomekrened brọns ekanna anye ekʌk. Abai anye ako, ye iyịre amọ, akedo ukem.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Adaiso mbon ukpeme amaamʌm Seraiya ekamba aku, Sefanaiya udiana ekamba aku ke ndaha ye mme akpeme inuausʌñ awo ita nte mbon ñkpakọb. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Ke atu mbon e-ekesʌkkọ eba ke abio, anye amaaben etubom ekọñ a-aseeghe ñkpọ abaña mme anwana ekọñ, ye mme anọitem adidem ition. Anye amaanyʌñ aben awedñwed a-akedooho etubom utañ mme awo nsịn ke ekọñ ye awo ata ke atu mbon e-ekedatta esịn ke ekọñ e-ekekịtte ke abio. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Nebusaradan a-adooho adaiso ekọñ amaakoono afịd ammọ asọk adidem Babilọn ke Ribla. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Do ke Ribla, ke isọñ Hamad, adidem Babilọn amaanam ewot ammọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 25:21">Ndin Yuda amaadʌk ufʌn, akpọñ isọñ amọ.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaamek Kedalia ayịn Ahikam, ayịn Safan, yak ase ñkpọ abaña mbon ake anye akekpọññọ ke Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Ke idaha afịd mme etubom ekọñ ye mbon ekọñ ekekoppo ke adidem Babilọn amaamek Kedalia nte adaiwuod ukara, ammọ, e-ekedooho Ismeel ayịn Netania, Yohanan ayịn Kare, Seraiya ayịn Tanumed awo Netofa, Yaasania ayịn mbon Maakad, ye ideen ammọ, emaekaa ebịne Kedalia ke Mispa. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Kedalia amaadat unwọñọ adisọọñọ ammọ ye ideen ammọ idem. Anye amaabo, “Ikiibaak mme adaaha Babilọn. Isuuk ibono ke isọñ ado inyʌñ inam ñkpọ inọ adidem Babilọn, ndin ayaafọn ye ndufo.”<verse eid="2KI 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, Ismeel ayịn Netania, ayịn Elisama, aketooho ubon ubọọñ, amaasaña ye awo duob ndin emaewot Kedalia ye mme ideen Yuda ye mbon Babilọn e-ekebaaha ye anye ke Mispa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Ke ntom, afịd awo tọọñọ ke andisịb ñkan wuọ andikpon ñkan, ye mme etubom udịmekọñ, emaefeeñe ekaa Iyib ato ke ndịk ammọ ekenieghe ebaña mbon Babilọn.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esaana Yehoiyakịn Eyaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme itiaba tọọñọ ekeben Yehoiyakịn adidem Yuda esio ke Yuda, ke isua Awel-Maaduk akedooho adidem Babilọn, anye amaasio Yehoiyakịn adidem Yuda ke ñkpakọb. Anye akenam ami ke ayọhọ usen edịb mme itiaba ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob mme iba. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Anye amaatañ ikọ emem-emem ye anye anyʌñ anọ anye itie ukpono akekoñño akan ake mme ndidem mfen ekebaaha ye anye ke Babilọn. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Ndin Yehoiyakịn amaasịññe afọñ ñkpakọb amọ ndin ke afịd ayio uwem amọ akedia ñkpọ ke akpokoro adidem. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Ke usen ke usen adidem amaanọ Yehoiyakịn akʌk ekpadafọñ ke ini ke ini ke afịd ayio uwem amọ.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>